AIT.put('k','2026-11-10-night',[{"h":"0xCodila","n":"codila","av":"media/t/0xcodila_av.webp","posts":[{"id":"2119859587293528490","t":"Anthropic, OpenAI and Google researchers spent $566,000 f*cking closed-source with reverse engineering - released 22-page PDF \n\nthey burned 5,000+ hours on it...\n\ntwist: anyone with AI can reverse engineer your product, unless you protect it right\n\n5 steps to protect yours + what else they found:\n\nalpha:\n\n• old anti-hacker tricks don't slow AI at all, it reads your compiled app like open source\n• real protection does: encrypted code + hidden keys dropped almost every AI to near zero. Claude fell from 5.33 to 0.32 out of 6, only one AI got through\n• with safety off, the top AI cracked 99% of apps in 4 tries, nothing is uncrackable\n• many other things in PDF below...\n\ntokens spent:\n\nlabs ran their own models for free - here's what the same test would cost YOU at public prices:\n\n- GPT 5.6 Cyber - $246.8k (773.6M tokens)\n- GPT 5.6 Sol - $161.9k (506.9M tokens)\n- GPT 6 Astra - $83.4k (215.7M tokens)\n- Claude Opus 5.5 - $52.3k (512.2M tokens)\n- Mythos 5.1 - $22k (362.9M  tokens)\n\ntotal: $566k for 2.37B tokens\n\nso how to protect yourself:\n\n1 → open Claude Code in your app's folder and say: \"install TruffleHog, build my app and scan the code, git history  and build with --results=verified\" \n- TruffleHog (29K) finds every live key hidden in your app \n\n2 → every live key it finds: revoke it, keep the new one on your server. Infisical (30.4K) keeps keys out of your code. \nIn the paper, server-side keys were among the hardest protections for AI\n\n3 → say: \"install Cloudflare's security-audit skill  with npx add cloudflare/security-audit-skill --skill security-audit -a claude-code, read its SKILL.md and run security audit\"\n- Cloudflare's skill (67.7K) finds the holes hackers look for once the've reversed your app\n\n4 → protect the code: app, site or game - BLA (4.2K), Android/iOS - O-MVLL (1.2K), and strip symbols before shipping - weaker Als lost 50-71% without them. \nsite? the browser hides nothing - anything secret goes to your server (step 2)\n\n5 → before every release, rerun steps 1 and 3 with the strongest model at max effort - the attacker will, it look one model from 5.8% to 55.8%\n\nRead full research, it will change your life. Then read article on how to reverse engineer anything:","ts":"2026-11-10 02:28","ed":"2026-11-10/night","why":"三大厂逆向闭源研究报告","m":[{"src":"media/x/3_2119846080342892544.jpg","type":"photo","w":1854,"h":2560,"t":"media/t/3_2119846080342892544.webp"}],"u":"https://x.com/0xCodila/status/2119859587293528490","pm":[23,16,133,5948],"tz":"Anthropic、OpenAI 和 Google 的研究人员花了 56.6 万美元，用逆向工程狠狠搞了一把闭源软件，发布了一份 22 页的 PDF\n\n他们在上面烧了 5000 多个小时……\n\n反转：任何人借助 AI 都能逆向你的产品，除非你做好防护\n\n保护你的产品的 5 个步骤 + 他们的其他发现：\n\n干货：\n\n• 老式的反黑客手段完全拖不慢 AI，它读你编译后的应用就像读开源代码一样\n• 真正有用的防护：加密代码 + 隐藏密钥，几乎让所有 AI 的成绩降到接近零。Claude 从 6 分里的 5.33 掉到 0.32，只有一个 AI 突破了\n• 关掉安全限制后，最强的 AI 在 4 次尝试内破解了 99% 的应用，没有什么是破解不了的\n• 还有很多内容见下面的 PDF……\n\n花掉的 token：\n\n实验室用自家模型是免费的——同样的测试如果按公开价格，你要花这么多：\n\n- GPT 5.6 Cyber - 24.68 万美元（7.736 亿 token）\n- GPT 5.6 Sol - 16.19 万美元（5.069 亿 token）\n- GPT 6 Astra - 8.34 万美元（2.157 亿 token）\n- Claude Opus 5.5 - 5.23 万美元（5.122 亿 token）\n- Mythos 5.1 - 2.2 万美元（3.629 亿 token）\n\n合计：23.7 亿 token，56.6 万美元\n\n那么怎么保护自己：\n\n1 → 在你应用的文件夹里打开 Claude Code，说：“安装 TruffleHog，构建我的应用并扫描代码、git 历史和构建产物，用 --results=verified”\n- TruffleHog（2.9 万星）能找出藏在你应用里的每一个有效密钥\n\n2 → 找到的每一个有效密钥：吊销它，把新密钥放在你的服务器上。Infisical（3.04 万星）能让密钥不进代码。\n论文中，服务器端密钥是 AI 最难突破的防护之一\n\n3 → 说：“用 npx add cloudflare/security-audit-skill --skill security-audit -a claude-code 安装 Cloudflare 的 security-audit 技能，读它的 SKILL.md 并运行安全审计”\n- Cloudflare 的这个技能（6.77 万星）能找出黑客逆向你的应用后会去找的漏洞\n\n4 → 保护代码：应用、网站或游戏用 BLA（4200 星），Android/iOS 用 O-MVLL（1200 星），发布前去掉符号——没有符号时，较弱的 AI 成绩下降了 50–71%。\n网站？浏览器什么都藏不住——任何机密都要放到你的服务器上（第 2 步）\n\n5 → 每次发布前，用最强模型的最高档位重跑第 1 步和第 3 步——攻击者会这么做，这让一个模型的成绩从 5.8% 提升到了 55.8%\n\n读读完整研究，它会改变你的人生。然后再读读这篇关于如何逆向任何东西的文章："}]},{"h":"0xlangeai","n":"蓝哥AI","av":"media/t/0xlangeai_av.webp","posts":[{"id":"2119792328005337120","t":"DeepSeek Harness 是真的超火,   入门到精通的教程都来了,  学不学就随你了 [[https://twitter.com/leaf_sanren/status/2119784114232729950|x.com/leaf_sanren/st…]]","ts":"2026-11-09 22:00","ed":"2026-11-10/night","why":"DeepSeek Harness教程合集","m":[],"u":"https://x.com/0xlangeai/status/2119792328005337120","pm":[4,13,54,6846]}]},{"h":"0xLogicrw","n":"思维怪怪","av":"media/t/0xlogicrw_av.webp","posts":[{"id":"2119750796476829832","t":"开源项目 Swipt 让 iPhone 可以自己运行自动化脚本，读取其他 App 的界面、点击按钮、输入文字，还能通过 MCP 接受 Claude Code 等 AI Agent 的指令。\n\n之前介绍的多数 iPhone Use 项目，都需要电脑持续运行，通过蓝牙、WDA 或苹果开发者接口控制手机。Swipt 则直接在 iPhone","ts":"2026-11-09 19:15","ed":"2026-11-10/night","why":"iPhone自动化接MCP","m":[],"u":"https://x.com/0xLogicrw/status/2119750796476829832","pm":[6,0,4,826]},{"id":"2119744561660764353","t":"GitHub 公布了代号为 Rubicon 的新一代 Git 存储架构。内部测试显示，5000 个 AI Agent 可以同时在一个代码仓库中工作，每秒完成 7200 次代码推送，同时保持较低的读取延迟。\n\n过去，GitHub 最繁忙的代码仓库，每秒也只有短时几十次写入。现在，大量 AI Agent","ts":"2026-11-09 18:51","ed":"2026-11-10/night","why":"GitHub新架构撑5000Agent","m":[],"u":"https://x.com/0xLogicrw/status/2119744561660764353","pm":[3,0,7,821]}]},{"h":"aigclink","n":"AIGCLINK","av":"media/t/aigclink_av.webp","posts":[{"id":"2119753763607237089","t":"布朗大学：让450个Agent不用生成冗长的文字推理，直接在潜空间中交换思路，程序搜索吞吐量提升5-13倍\n\n传统多Agent协作，通常需要每个Agent先生成一段文字，解释自己的思路，再把这些内容传递给其他Agent，由汇总Agent阅读、分析、整合\n\n如果你要让几百个Agent不断探索数学构造、优化算法或者说改进科学计算程序，每个Agent都生成大量文字Token，就会迅速增加时间和计算开销\n\n所以布朗大学提出了一个新框架：SwarmEvolve\n\n它的核心思路是，让Agent不必把中间推理过程转换成文字，而是在模型内部的潜空间中探索，通过KV Cache交换信息，最后由汇总Agent生成可执行程序\n\n简单说就是把多Agent协作从传统的文本通信，部分转向模型内部表示之间的通信\n\n其实验结果：\n在21个数学发现和科学计算问题上，用Qwen3 8B、14B、32B-FP8，对比OpenEvolve、ShinkaEvolve和CodeEvolve\n\n在单GPU、每次1小时的测试条件下，每小时评估的候选程序数量达到其他框架的5-13倍\n\n达到其他框架1小时成绩所需时间中位数仅3-8分钟\n\n整个工作流程是：\n1、每轮组织450个潜空间Agent\n把Agent分成不同群体，分别研究已有程序和不同改进方向，有的尝试已有数学构造，有的探索其他算法思路，有的研究如何组合不同方案\n\n每个Agent执行40步潜空间推理，不需要逐步生成文字CoT\n\n2、直接在潜空间筛选不同思路\n系统通过隐藏状态向量的余弦距离，筛选出差异较大的Agent。不需要先把所有思考过程生成文字，再让另一个模型逐一比较\n\n3、通过KV Cache实现跨Agent信息交换\n每个群体的汇总Agent读取筛选后成员的KV Cache，融合来自不同父代程序的探索信息，生成新的候选程序\n\n4、自动评估，再进入下一轮进化\n运行新程序、计算得分，保留表现较好的候选方案，再继续搜索和优化。整个过程仍然保留程序生成、测试和筛选，只是减少了中间大量文字推理与通信的开销\n\n现在大量Multi-Agent框架依赖自然语言通信，SwarmEvolve等于说给了一条新路径\n\n#SwarmEvolve #MultiAgent #潜空间推理","ts":"2026-11-09 19:27","ed":"2026-11-10/night","why":"450个Agent潜空间协作","m":[{"src":"media/x/16_2119749181544054784.jpg","type":"animated_gif","w":1248,"h":640,"t":"media/t/16_2119749181544054784.webp"}],"u":"https://x.com/aigclink/status/2119753763607237089","pm":[14,15,40,3807]}]},{"h":"AlchainHust","n":"花叔","av":"media/t/alchainhust_av.webp","posts":[{"id":"2119948102698475938","t":"字节新出的Seedream 5.5，我拿一张人像连改了20轮再改回来，她还是她。七百多字的航线图一个错字都没有，透明底也能直出了。文末附一个用它做GIF表情包的教程，skill已开源～ [[https://x.com/i/article/2119946484116488192|x.com/i/article/2119…]]","ts":"2026-11-10 08:19","ed":"2026-11-10/night","why":"Seedream 5.5实测附教程","m":[],"u":"https://x.com/AlchainHust/status/2119948102698475938","pm":[5,0,6,2173]}]},{"h":"AndrewCurran_","n":"Andrew Curran","av":"media/t/andrewcurran__av.webp","posts":[{"id":"2119930955888746627","t":"Anthropic's most capable model remains hidden deep within their tower. Source: Fable/Mythos 5.2 System Card.","ts":"2026-11-10 07:11","ed":"2026-11-10/night","why":"系统卡称最强模型未公开","m":[{"src":"media/x/3_2119930953238040576.jpg","type":"photo","w":1080,"h":691,"t":"media/t/3_2119930953238040576.webp"}],"u":"https://x.com/AndrewCurran_/status/2119930955888746627","pm":[47,23,478,30101],"tz":"Anthropic 最强的模型依然深藏在他们的高塔里。来源：Fable/Mythos 5.2 系统卡。"},{"id":"2119885310301778168","t":"As I predicted, Claude is off the leash. Fable 5.2 has solved two open problems in theoretical physics, one of them completely autonomously.  [[https://twitter.com/AndrewCurran_/status/2119429008496693738|x.com/AndrewCurran_/…]]","ts":"2026-11-10 04:10","ed":"2026-11-10/night","why":"Fable 5.2解决物理难题","m":[{"src":"media/x/3_2119885306883391489.jpg","type":"photo","w":1080,"h":1145,"t":"media/t/3_2119885306883391489.webp"}],"u":"https://x.com/AndrewCurran_/status/2119885310301778168","pm":[57,153,1397,42353],"tz":"正如我预测的，Claude 已经脱缰了。Fable 5.2 解决了理论物理中的两个开放问题，其中一个是完全自主解决的。  [[https://twitter.com/AndrewCurran_/status/2119429008496693738|x.com/AndrewCurran_/…]]"}]},{"h":"antiAIvo","n":"纳米AI","av":"media/t/antiaivo_av.webp","posts":[{"id":"2119774298198143398","t":"学习 DeepSeek Harness 之 TypeScript 原型链\n\n为了搞懂 DSH 底下的插件框架 Cordis\n学 TypeScript 时发现一个很有意思的点\n准确说是 JavaScript 的特性：对象可以直接继承另一个对象\n\n举个例子：\nconst b = Object.create(a)   // b 以 a 为原型\nconst c = Object.create(b)   // c 以 b 为原型\nc.x","ts":"2026-11-09 20:49","ed":"2026-11-10/night","why":"读DeepSeek Harness源码","m":[{"src":"media/x/3_2119772963230932992.jpg","type":"photo","w":3200,"h":1800,"t":"media/t/3_2119772963230932992.webp"}],"u":"https://x.com/antiAIvo/status/2119774298198143398","pm":[12,3,68,4057]}]},{"h":"antigravity","n":"Google Antigravity","av":"media/t/antigravity_av.webp","posts":[{"id":"2119913586109579283","t":"Today, we are launching a new Knowledge Work interface layout tuned for research, writing, and artifacts: same agent harness, plugins, and MCP tools, without the terminal and git clutter. Select your layout in the General tab of Settings.\n\nOur goal with Antigravity is to help the world deliver value through products and research. Doing that always starts with building the logic, which is why software development is at the core of the product. But turning that work into real outcomes takes every role working together with a shared language and understanding.","ts":"2026-11-10 06:02","ed":"2026-11-10/night","why":"Antigravity知识工作布局","m":[{"src":"media/x/13_2119913540668596226.jpg","type":"video","w":1920,"h":1080,"t":"media/t/13_2119913540668596226.webp"}],"u":"https://x.com/antigravity/status/2119913586109579283","pm":[84,110,1529,72424],"tz":"今天我们推出全新的“知识工作”界面布局，专为研究、写作和生成成果物而优化：同样的智能体框架、插件和 MCP 工具，但没有终端和 git 的杂乱。在设置的“通用”标签页里选择你的布局即可。\n\n我们做 Antigravity 的目标，是帮助世界通过产品和研究创造价值。这总是从构建逻辑开始，所以软件开发是这个产品的核心。但要把这些工作变成真正的成果，需要每个岗位用共同的语言和理解一起协作。"}]},{"h":"ArtificialAnlys","n":"Artificial Analysis","av":"media/t/artificialanlys_av.webp","posts":[{"id":"2119878995386982508","t":"Anthropic has released Claude Fable 5.2, taking the #1 spot on the Artificial Analysis Intelligence Index v5 at 65, led by gains in science, knowledge, and coding\n\nAt max effort it scores 65, 5 points ahead of Gemini 4 Carbon (high, 60) and 6 ahead of Claude Opus 5.5 (max, 59). Gains are driven by scientific reasoning, knowledge and FrontierCode 2.0, and roughly matching Opus 5.5 on AA-Briefcase and Terminal-Bench 4.0.\n\nPriced at $8/$40 per 1M input/output tokens, a 20% reduction from Fable 5.1, Claude Fable 5.2 averages a Cost per Task of $26.5 with max effort, a ~2.6x increase compared to Opus 5.5 (max, $10.0) and ~2x compared to Fable 5.1 (max, $12.99)\n\nKey takeaways:\n\n➤ Claude Fable 5.2 leads 5 of the 9 evaluations in the Intelligence Index: At max effort, Fable 5.2 scores 65, ahead of Gemini 4 Carbon (high, 60), Claude Opus 5.5 (max, 59) and GPT-6 Astra (max, 57), and ~15 points above Claude Fable 5.1 (max, 49). It sets the highest scores on HLE-Diamond (80%, previous best 69% from Gemini 4 Carbon), AA-Omniscience v1.1 (67, previous best 54 from Gemini 4 Carbon), Terminal-Bench-Science (73%, previous best 65% from Gemini 4 Carbon), CritPt v2 hard subset (77%, previous best 72% from GPT-6 Astra) and FrontierCode 2.0 (49%, previous best 46% from Claude Opus 5.5)\n\n➤ Less progress in agentic knowledge work and terminal coding: Claude Fable 5.2 improves on Fable 5.1 across capabilities, but sometimes only to Opus 5.5 levels. It reaches 1785 Elo on AA-Briefcase, within the confidence interval of Opus 5.5 (1800) and just behind Claude Sonnet 5.5 (1813). On GDP.pdf it reaches 24% all-pass against 26% for Opus 5.5. On Terminal-Bench 4.0 it scores 60%, level with Opus 5.5 and behind Kimi K3.1 Pro (67%), Gemini 4 Carbon (65%) and Sonnet 5.5 (64%). AutomationBench-AA is an exception, at 76% against 70% for Opus 5.5, narrowly behind Gemini 4 Carbon, 78%\n\n➤ Lower efforts still take leading positions: With high and xhigh effort, Claude Fable 5.2 scores 62, ahead of every other model at any effort, using 98k output tokens per task against 173k for Opus 5.5 (max). At max effort Fable 5.2 costs ~2.6x more than Opus 5.5, but at lower effort settings it can outperform Opus 5.5 at lower cost per task\n\nOther model details:\n\n➤ Context window: 1 million tokens with image and text input\n\n➤ Pricing: $8/$40 per 1M input/output tokens; cache writes $10 with 5-minute TTL, $16 with 1-hour TTL, and cache reads $0.20\n\n➤ Effort settings: five (low, medium, high, xhigh, max). Intelligence Index evaluations were run at all five with Anthropic's default fallback enabled\n\nCongratulations to @AnthropicAI on this impressive release!","ts":"2026-11-10 03:45","ed":"2026-11-10/night","why":"Fable 5.2登顶AA智能榜","m":[{"src":"media/x/3_2119878346511437824.jpg","type":"photo","w":2440,"h":2192,"t":"media/t/3_2119878346511437824.webp"}],"u":"https://x.com/ArtificialAnlys/status/2119878995386982508","pm":[78,154,2093,147097],"tz":"Anthropic 发布了 Claude Fable 5.2，以 65 分登上 Artificial Analysis 智能指数 v5 榜首，主要得益于科学、知识和编程方面的进步\n\n在 max 档位下它得 65 分，比 Gemini 4 Carbon（high，60）高 5 分，比 Claude Opus 5.5（max，59）高 6 分。提升主要来自科学推理、知识和 FrontierCode 2.0，在 AA-Briefcase 和 Terminal-Bench 4.0 上与 Opus 5.5 大致持平。\n\n定价为每百万输入/输出 token 8 美元/40 美元，比 Fable 5.1 降了 20%。Claude Fable 5.2 在 max 档位下每个任务平均成本 26.5 美元，约为 Opus 5.5（max，10.0 美元）的 2.6 倍，约为 Fable 5.1（max，12.99 美元）的 2 倍\n\n要点：\n\n➤ Claude Fable 5.2 在智能指数 9 项评测中领先 5 项：在 max 档位下，Fable 5.2 得 65 分，超过 Gemini 4 Carbon（high，60）、Claude Opus 5.5（max，59）和 GPT-6 Astra（max，57），比 Claude Fable 5.1（max，49）高约 15 分。它在 HLE-Diamond（80%，此前最好是 Gemini 4 Carbon 的 69%）、AA-Omniscience v1.1（67，此前最好是 Gemini 4 Carbon 的 54）、Terminal-Bench-Science（73%，此前最好是 Gemini 4 Carbon 的 65%）、CritPt v2 困难子集（77%，此前最好是 GPT-6 Astra 的 72%）和 FrontierCode 2.0（49%，此前最好是 Claude Opus 5.5 的 46%）上都创下最高分\n\n➤ 智能体知识工作和终端编程进步较小：Claude Fable 5.2 各方面都比 Fable 5.1 强，但有时只是追平 Opus 5.5。它在 AA-Briefcase 上达到 1785 Elo，落在 Opus 5.5（1800）的置信区间内，略低于 Claude Sonnet 5.5（1813）。在 GDP.pdf 上全部通过率为 24%，Opus 5.5 为 26%。在 Terminal-Bench 4.0 上得 60%，与 Opus 5.5 持平，落后于 Kimi K3.1 Pro（67%）、Gemini 4 Carbon（65%）和 Sonnet 5.5（64%）。AutomationBench-AA 是个例外，得 76%，高于 Opus 5.5 的 70%，略低于 Gemini 4 Carbon 的 78%\n\n➤ 较低档位依然领先：在 high 和 xhigh 档位下，Claude Fable 5.2 得 62 分，超过其他任何模型的任何档位，每个任务用 9.8 万输出 token，而 Opus 5.5（max）要 17.3 万。在 max 档位下 Fable 5.2 的成本约为 Opus 5.5 的 2.6 倍，但在较低档位下，它能以更低的单任务成本超过 Opus 5.5\n\n其他模型细节：\n\n➤ 上下文窗口：100 万 token，支持图像和文本输入\n\n➤ 定价：每百万输入/输出 token 8 美元/40 美元；缓存写入 5 分钟 TTL 为 10 美元、1 小时 TTL 为 16 美元，缓存读取 0.20 美元\n\n➤ 思考档位：五档（low、medium、high、xhigh、max）。智能指数评测在全部五档下运行，并开启了 Anthropic 默认的回退机制\n\n祝贺 @AnthropicAI 带来这次出色的发布！"},{"id":"2119854348587123007","t":"Meta's newest model Muse Ember scores 36 on the Artificial Analysis Intelligence Index, matching Claude Haiku 5.5 (max) at a third of the Cost per Task\n\nMuse Ember is Meta's newest efficient-tier model line, with the same input and output token prices as Claude Haiku 5.5 and GPT-6 Luna\n\nKey Takeaways:\n\n➤ On the Intelligence Index vs. Cost per Task Pareto frontier at both max and xhigh effort. Muse Ember (max) is the cheapest model scoring 36 or higher, at $0.14 per task, and Muse Ember (xhigh) scores 34 for $0.12. Claude Haiku 5.5 (max) costs almost 3x more at $0.41 for the same score as Muse Ember (max). Muse Ember (max) is also about 4x cheaper than DeepSeek V4.1 Flash 1017 (max, 33, $0.60) and GLM-5.3-Flash (28, $0.58)\n\n➤ 8 points behind Muse Wonder for about 1/50th of the Cost per Task. Muse Wonder (max) scores 44 at $6.95 per Intelligence Index task\n\n➤ Stands out on AutomationBench-AA. Muse Ember (max) scores 68.1% on AutomationBench-AA, level with Muse Wonder (max), and beats Claude Haiku 5.5 (max) on GDP.pdf (22.8% vs 20.8%), but trails it on AA-Briefcase (1521 vs 1574 Elo)\n\n➤ Mixed in agentic coding in our Intelligence Index evaluations. It beats Claude Haiku 5.5 (max) on Terminal-Bench 4.0 (40.9% vs 32.8%) but trails it on FrontierCode 2.0 (27.2% vs 34.9%)\n\n➤ Ahead of similarly priced models when running in its own coding agent. In Muse Code, Muse Ember (max) scores 46 on the Artificial Analysis Coding Agent Index, ahead of Claude Haiku 5.5 in Claude Code (max, 37) and GPT-6 Luna in Codex (max, 31)\n\n➤ Knowledge is the main weakness, but it rarely hallucinates. Its AA-Omniscience accuracy of 21.1% is the lowest of the similarly intelligent models we compared, against 34.7% for Claude Haiku 5.5 (max) and 50.5% for Gemini 3.8 Flash (high). This is mostly because it declines to answer 64% of questions, which keeps its hallucination rate at 17.4%, half of Claude Haiku 5.5’s (max)\n\nOther details:\n➤ Pricing: $0.10 input / $0.004 cached input / $0.50 output per 1M tokens\n➤ Reasoning effort: results shown at max effort, with xhigh also on the Intelligence vs. Cost chart ➤ Availability: Meta's first-party API and Muse Code","ts":"2026-11-10 02:07","ed":"2026-11-10/night","why":"Meta Muse Ember评测","m":[{"src":"media/x/3_2119853878804152320.jpg","type":"photo","w":2424,"h":2252,"t":"media/t/3_2119853878804152320.webp"}],"u":"https://x.com/ArtificialAnlys/status/2119854348587123007","pm":[71,41,789,103449],"tz":"Meta 最新模型 Muse Ember 在 Artificial Analysis 智能指数上得 36 分，与 Claude Haiku 5.5（max）持平，而单任务成本只有其三分之一\n\nMuse Ember 是 Meta 最新的效率档模型系列，输入和输出 token 价格与 Claude Haiku 5.5 和 GPT-6 Luna 相同\n\n要点：\n\n➤ 在 max 和 xhigh 档位下都处在“智能指数 vs 单任务成本”的帕累托前沿。Muse Ember（max）是得分 36 及以上的模型里最便宜的，每个任务 0.14 美元；Muse Ember（xhigh）得 34 分，成本 0.12 美元。Claude Haiku 5.5（max）拿到与 Muse Ember（max）相同的分数，成本却高出近 3 倍，为 0.41 美元。Muse Ember（max）也比 DeepSeek V4.1 Flash 1017（max，33 分，0.60 美元）和 GLM-5.3-Flash（28 分，0.58 美元）便宜约 4 倍\n\n➤ 比 Muse Wonder 低 8 分，但单任务成本只有其约 1/50。Muse Wonder（max）得 44 分，每个智能指数任务 6.95 美元\n\n➤ 在 AutomationBench-AA 上表现突出。Muse Ember（max）在 AutomationBench-AA 上得 68.1%，与 Muse Wonder（max）持平；在 GDP.pdf 上胜过 Claude Haiku 5.5（max）（22.8% 对 20.8%），但在 AA-Briefcase 上落后（1521 对 1574 Elo）\n\n➤ 在我们智能指数评测中的智能体编程表现有好有坏。它在 Terminal-Bench 4.0 上胜过 Claude Haiku 5.5（max）（40.9% 对 32.8%），但在 FrontierCode 2.0 上落后（27.2% 对 34.9%）\n\n➤ 在自家编程智能体中运行时领先同价位模型。在 Muse Code 中，Muse Ember（max）在 Artificial Analysis 编程智能体指数上得 46 分，高于在 Claude Code 中运行的 Claude Haiku 5.5（max，37）和在 Codex 中运行的 GPT-6 Luna（max，31）\n\n➤ 知识是主要短板，但它很少胡编。它在 AA-Omniscience 上的准确率为 21.1%，是我们对比的同等智能模型中最低的，Claude Haiku 5.5（max）为 34.7%，Gemini 3.8 Flash（high）为 50.5%。这主要是因为它拒答了 64% 的问题，从而把幻觉率压在 17.4%，只有 Claude Haiku 5.5（max）的一半\n\n其他细节：\n➤ 定价：每百万 token 输入 0.10 美元 / 缓存输入 0.004 美元 / 输出 0.50 美元\n➤ 推理档位：展示的是 max 档位结果，xhigh 也出现在智能 vs 成本图中 ➤ 可用渠道：Meta 官方 API 和 Muse Code"}]},{"h":"bcherny","n":"Boris Cherny","av":"media/t/bcherny_av.webp","posts":[{"id":"2119873095129550880","t":"We wanted to do more for the people who’ve been with us the longest. So with Fable 5.2, the longer you’ve been subscribed, the more Fable resets you get.  [[https://twitter.com/claudeai/status/2119867114450268322|x.com/claudeai/statu…]]","ts":"2026-11-10 03:21","ed":"2026-11-10/night","why":"订阅越久送越多重置","m":[{"src":"media/x/3_2119873075575664640.jpg","type":"photo","w":996,"h":402,"t":"media/t/3_2119873075575664640.webp"}],"u":"https://x.com/bcherny/status/2119873095129550880","pm":[984,472,12456,465352],"tz":"我们想为陪伴我们最久的用户多做一些。所以在 Fable 5.2 上，你订阅得越久，获得的 Fable 重置次数就越多。  [[https://twitter.com/claudeai/status/2119867114450268322|x.com/claudeai/statu…]]"}]},{"h":"berryxia","n":"Berryxia.AI","av":"media/t/berryxia_av.webp","posts":[{"id":"2119947402107089168","t":"我去，Fable 5.2 简直太神了！ ！！\n分分钟给你搓出你想要的一切啊！\n\n早起后，看到Fable 5.2发布，迫不及待找点活干！\n\n正好前几天在视频号刷到一个博主做的类似桌面整理文件的扫地机器人形式，我也想自己做一下，于是用fable 5.2 对话了几轮，按照要求迭代了一下，他直接实现了我的对应想法。","ts":"2026-11-10 08:17","ed":"2026-11-10/night","why":"用Fable 5.2做整理机器人","m":[{"src":"media/x/13_2119944946480451584.jpg","type":"video","w":1920,"h":1080,"t":"media/t/13_2119944946480451584.webp"}],"u":"https://x.com/berryxia/status/2119947402107089168","pm":[7,0,7,565]}]},{"h":"ChrisGPT","n":"Chris","av":"media/t/chrisgpt_av.webp","posts":[{"id":"2119868454383616120","t":"FABLE 5.2 BENCHMARKS ARE HERE!\n\n• FrontierCode 2.0: 49.1% vs 32.4% for 5.1\n• Remote Labor Index: 41.3% vs 17.9%\n• AA-Briefcase: 66.1% vs 61.5%\n\nA massive jump in coding and remote work performance from 5.1. They could’ve easily called this 5.5\n\nThey’re adding in robotics and","ts":"2026-11-10 03:03","ed":"2026-11-10/night","why":"Fable 5.2基准数据","m":[{"src":"media/x/3_2119868451569143809.jpg","type":"photo","w":1342,"h":1140,"t":"media/t/3_2119868451569143809.webp"}],"u":"https://x.com/ChrisGPT/status/2119868454383616120","pm":[12,4,342,12624],"tz":"FABLE 5.2 基准成绩来了！\n\n• FrontierCode 2.0：49.1%，5.1 为 32.4%\n• Remote Labor Index：41.3%，此前为 17.9%\n• AA-Briefcase：66.1%，此前为 61.5%\n\n相比 5.1，编程和远程工作表现大幅跃升。他们完全可以把它叫作 5.5\n\n他们还加入了机器人和"}]},{"h":"claudeai","n":"Claude","av":"media/t/claudeai_av.webp","posts":[{"id":"2119899459761131615","t":"During pre-release testing, Claude Fable 5.2 and Claude Mythos 5.2 worked on ambitious projects in many different fields. Here are a few.\n\nFrom a one-paragraph prompt, Fable 5.2 designed three working electronic devices, including this home voice assistant hub.","ts":"2026-11-10 05:06","ed":"2026-11-10/night","why":"一段话设计三台设备","m":[{"src":"media/x/13_2119889970664030208.jpg","type":"video","w":3840,"h":2160,"t":"media/t/13_2119889970664030208.webp"}],"u":"https://x.com/claudeai/status/2119899459761131615","pm":[349,803,15067,904873],"tz":"在发布前的测试中，Claude Fable 5.2 和 Claude Mythos 5.2 参与了许多不同领域的宏大项目。下面是其中几个。\n\n只凭一段话的提示词，Fable 5.2 就设计出了三台能正常工作的电子设备，包括这台家用语音助手中枢。"},{"id":"2119867114450268322","t":"Introducing Claude Fable 5.2 and Claude Mythos 5.2, designed to tackle the most daunting technical challenges.\n\nThey’re capable collaborators on ambitious projects in many fields, and show improvements in areas like coding, reasoning, and vision.","ts":"2026-11-10 02:57","ed":"2026-11-10/night","why":"Fable与Mythos 5.2发布","m":[{"src":"media/x/13_2119862225028452352.jpg","type":"video","w":3840,"h":2160,"t":"media/t/13_2119862225028452352.webp"}],"u":"https://x.com/claudeai/status/2119867114450268322","pm":[2401,7037,74104,8159009],"tz":"隆重推出 Claude Fable 5.2 和 Claude Mythos 5.2，专为攻克最艰巨的技术挑战而打造。\n\n它们是能在许多领域参与宏大项目的得力搭档，在编程、推理和视觉等方面都有提升。"}]},{"h":"cognition","n":"Cognition","av":"media/t/cognition_av.webp","posts":[{"id":"2119869931135406452","t":"Claude Fable 5.2 is now available in Devin Desktop and Devin CLI.\n\nOn FrontierCode 2.0, Fable 5.2 takes the #1 spot at a score of 49.1. \n\nFable 5.2 also introduces a significant price improvement from Fable 5.1: at low reasoning effort, it surpasses its predecessor’s score at a third of the cost.","ts":"2026-11-10 03:09","ed":"2026-11-10/night","why":"Devin接入Fable 5.2","m":[{"src":"media/x/3_2119868672164700160.jpg","type":"photo","w":1930,"h":1366,"t":"media/t/3_2119868672164700160.webp"}],"u":"https://x.com/cognition/status/2119869931135406452","pm":[29,21,371,34615],"tz":"Claude Fable 5.2 现已在 Devin Desktop 和 Devin CLI 中上线。\n\n在 FrontierCode 2.0 上，Fable 5.2 以 49.1 分位居第一。\n\nFable 5.2 相比 Fable 5.1 价格也大幅优化：在低推理档位下，它以三分之一的成本超过了前代的分数。"}]},{"h":"dongxi_nlp","n":"Dongxi 东锡 NLP","av":"media/t/dongxi_nlp_av.webp","posts":[{"id":"2119908686386585990","t":"才周一，就是本周最佳！\n\n如果本周只能读一篇 paper，就是这篇！\n\nUnderstanding AI from the Inside: \nThe State of Mechanistic Interpretability for AI Safety","ts":"2026-11-10 05:43","ed":"2026-11-10/night","why":"机制可解释性综述推荐","m":[],"u":"https://x.com/dongxi_nlp/status/2119908686386585990","pm":[10,17,87,8384]}]},{"h":"dotey","n":"宝玉","av":"media/t/dotey_av.webp","posts":[{"id":"2119894229581508868","t":"每次新模型发布就是清理精简提示词的好机会（前提是你以后一直用新模型）\n\n> “阅读整个项目，找出所有损坏、不一致、低效或不再需要的东西。修复你确信的部分，并将其余部分列出供我审查。”","ts":"2026-11-10 04:45","ed":"2026-11-10/night","why":"新模型上线清理提示词妙招","m":[],"u":"https://x.com/dotey/status/2119894229581508868","pm":[22,15,231,18739]},{"id":"2119872207241543744","t":"Claude Fable 5.2 发布：比 Opus 5.5 强一档，API 降价两成；Max、Ultra 送 1 次Fable reset，Pro 这一周也可以直接用 Fable\n\nAnthropic 11 月 9 日发布 Claude Fable 5.2 和 Claude Mythos 5.2，这是它最高端的一档模型。官方说，在测过的几乎所有能力上，新模型都比 Opus 5.5 强一档；输出速度比 5.1","ts":"2026-11-10 03:18","ed":"2026-11-10/night","why":"Fable 5.2发布要点中文梳理","m":[],"u":"https://x.com/dotey/status/2119872207241543744","pm":[51,15,224,71894]}]},{"h":"dwarkesh_sp","n":"Dwarkesh Patel","av":"media/t/dwarkesh_sp_av.webp","posts":[{"id":"2119942657812451482","t":"At Blood on the Clocktower, Fable 5.2 is still worse than GPT-6 Astra.\n\nThough much better than Opus 5.5 or Fable 5.1  [[https://twitter.com/dwarkesh_sp/status/2118449808402681911|x.com/dwarkesh_sp/st…]]","ts":"2026-11-10 07:58","ed":"2026-11-10/night","why":"社交推理游戏测Fable","m":[{"src":"media/x/3_2119941967694200832.jpg","type":"photo","w":2400,"h":1544,"t":"media/t/3_2119941967694200832.webp"}],"u":"https://x.com/dwarkesh_sp/status/2119942657812451482","pm":[33,9,344,21650],"tz":"在《血染钟楼》（Blood on the Clocktower）里，Fable 5.2 仍然不如 GPT-6 Astra。\n\n不过比 Opus 5.5 和 Fable 5.1 好多了  [[https://twitter.com/dwarkesh_sp/status/2118449808402681911|x.com/dwarkesh_sp/st…]]"}]},{"h":"emollick","n":"Ethan Mollick","av":"media/t/emollick_av.webp","posts":[{"id":"2119918307457577163","t":"In one of my favorite experiments, I told Fable 5.2 to build an endless, hands-off journey through 3D worlds linked by portals. \n\n25,000 agents created over 450 worlds inspired by books, art, places, all in code.\n\nPlay: [[https://portals-endless-worlds.netlify.app/|portals-endless-worlds.netlify.app]]\nGithub: [[https://github.com/emollick/ai-portals|github.com/emollick/ai-po…]]","ts":"2026-11-10 06:21","ed":"2026-11-10/night","why":"Fable 5.2做3D世界漫游","m":[{"src":"media/x/13_2119916822719840256.jpg","type":"video","w":1280,"h":720,"t":"media/t/13_2119916822719840256.webp"}],"u":"https://x.com/emollick/status/2119918307457577163","pm":[95,55,569,25870],"tz":"在我最喜欢的一个实验里，我让 Fable 5.2 做一场无尽的、全自动的 3D 世界之旅，各个世界通过传送门相连。\n\n25000 个智能体用代码创造了 450 多个世界，灵感来自书籍、艺术和各地风景。\n\n试玩：[[https://portals-endless-worlds.netlify.app/|portals-endless-worlds.netlify.app]]\nGithub：[[https://github.com/emollick/ai-portals|github.com/emollick/ai-po…]]"},{"id":"2119870150845599972","t":"I had early access to Fable 5.2 for a bit & I think  it crosses the line into being a sort of Jagged AGI. Here, I have it launch a business, do academic research, hack hardware, build 3D models & more. I think it is a good illustration of limits & powers: [[https://www.oneusefulthing.org/p/fable-52-and-jagged-agi|oneusefulthing.org/p/fable-52-and…]]","ts":"2026-11-10 03:10","ed":"2026-11-10/night","why":"试用Fable 5.2称参差AGI","m":[],"u":"https://x.com/emollick/status/2119870150845599972","pm":[170,218,2861,380238],"tz":"我提前用了一段时间 Fable 5.2，我觉得它已经越过了那条线，成了某种“参差不齐的 AGI”。在这篇文章里，我让它开一门生意、做学术研究、破解硬件、做 3D 模型等等。我觉得这很好地展示了它的局限和能力：[[https://www.oneusefulthing.org/p/fable-52-and-jagged-agi|oneusefulthing.org/p/fable-52-and…]]"}]},{"h":"FinanceYF5","n":"AI Will","av":"media/t/financeyf5_av.webp","posts":[{"id":"2119950408290611510","t":"1/ Claude 同时发布 Fable 5.2 与 Mythos 5.2。\n\n两款模型面向高难度技术项目，在编码、推理和视觉能力上都有提升。官方称，它们在几乎所有评估能力上都超过 Opus 5.5，部分任务成本仅为一半。\n\n具体表现👇","ts":"2026-11-10 08:28","ed":"2026-11-10/night","why":"Fable 5.2发布梳理","m":[{"src":"media/x/13_2119950383309340672.jpg","type":"video","w":1920,"h":1080,"t":"media/t/13_2119950383309340672.webp"}],"u":"https://x.com/FinanceYF5/status/2119950408290611510","pm":[4,0,2,803]}]},{"h":"GitHub_Daily","n":"GitHubDaily","av":"media/t/github_daily_av.webp","posts":[{"id":"2119799700044083572","t":"不想露脸又想做科普视频，火柴人动画是个好路子，可一集画下来，分镜、配音、字幕得忙好几天。\n\nStickman Video Director 是一个做火柴人视频的 Skill，给它一个话题、一篇文章或一份脚本，就能做成带配音、字幕和音效的成片。\n\n有两种用法，导演模式出分镜和每个镜头的视频提示词，拿去视频生成工具里出片自己剪，自动模式直接交付完整视频。\n\nGitHub：[[http://github.com/kaomei/stickman-video-director|github.com/kaomei/stickma…]]\n\n自动模式适合 10 分钟以上的长视频，在 Codex 或 Claude Code 里跑，先给一段 20 秒带声音的预览，确认了再做全片。\n\n内置 10 种画风，经典黑白、复古电视、洞穴壁画都有，横屏、竖屏、方形都能出。\n\n作者推荐先用 Codex 跑，他自己的示例都是这么做的。做知识类频道的，可以拿一个小话题先试一条。","ts":"2026-11-09 22:30","ed":"2026-11-10/night","why":"火柴人科普视频Skill","m":[{"src":"media/x/3_2119799684265082880.jpg","type":"photo","w":2364,"h":2492,"t":"media/t/3_2119799684265082880.webp"},{"src":"media/x/3_2119799684193755136.jpg","type":"photo","w":2368,"h":2748,"t":"media/t/3_2119799684193755136.webp"}],"u":"https://x.com/GitHub_Daily/status/2119799700044083572","pm":[5,9,87,4834]},{"id":"2119731747197972672","t":"订阅的 RSS 越来越多，每天想读的文章根本读不完，通勤路上又不方便盯着屏幕看。\n\nrss-pod 能把 RSS 里的文章变成几个人对谈的播客，开车、走路的时候戴上耳机就能听。\n\n背后先让大模型把文章改写成对话脚本，再用 Edge TTS 或 Azure 合成多人的声音，最后在网页播放器里收听，也能生成播客订阅地址。\n\nGitHub：[[http://github.com/synrise25/rss-pod|github.com/synrise25/rss-…]]\n\n对话的角色和声音都能自己定，还能先让模型筛一遍，不想听的内容直接跳过。\n\n中途出错或者重启，会从做完的那一步接着来。作者放了一期 3 分多钟的样片，聊五年后写代码还能不能养家。\n\n需要自己部署，一个程序或一个 Docker 容器就能跑。读不完的东西换成耳朵听，这个用法我觉得很实在。","ts":"2026-11-09 18:00","ed":"2026-11-10/night","why":"RSS转AI对谈播客","m":[{"src":"media/x/3_2119731735084810240.jpg","type":"photo","w":2380,"h":2676,"t":"media/t/3_2119731735084810240.webp"}],"u":"https://x.com/GitHub_Daily/status/2119731747197972672","pm":[8,4,21,2497]}]},{"h":"Gorden_Sun","n":"Gorden Sun","av":"media/t/gorden_sun_av.webp","posts":[{"id":"2119810857920307387","t":"Mirage：仅22MB的超轻量多功能视觉AI模型\n\n仅有5130万参数的视觉模型，并通过专门的2比特量化技术将体积压缩到约22MB。在实际使用中，模型在三星S26手机的NPU上只需74毫秒就能完成单次全流程分析。\n\n它能在一瞬间看懂画面中的场景环境，精准圈出各类物品并生成精细轮廓，自动读取图片里的招牌或标签文字，理清物体之间的空间关系，还能根据预设的选项直接给出判断结果，最终输出整齐规范的结构化数据供各类应用程序直接使用。\n\n模型：[[https://huggingface.co/Cactus-Compute/mirage|huggingface.co/Cactus-Compute…]]","ts":"2026-11-09 23:14","ed":"2026-11-10/night","why":"22MB超轻量视觉模型","m":[{"src":"media/x/3_2119810844251074562.jpg","type":"photo","w":1600,"h":1260,"t":"media/t/3_2119810844251074562.webp"}],"u":"https://x.com/Gorden_Sun/status/2119810857920307387","pm":[15,19,140,7956]},{"id":"2119742606460813495","t":"billion-context：节省上下文的Agent插件\n\nbillion-context充当客户端和AI模型之间的智能中继站，\n开启之后，它能让单次长会话稳定运行长达一个月，处理数十亿token的数据量而不会撑爆100K的小窗口，整体消耗节省至原来的五分之一。对话中较早的历史内容会被自动折叠压缩，需要细节时又能随时无损还原，在保证AI回复准确度的同时，还能维持95%以上的前缀缓存命中率。\n\n核心原理是在客户端与大模型之间架设一层智能代理，通过让模型自主调用压缩工具，实现动态的分层摘要与无损还原。billion-context向对话上下文中注入了四个专用的上下文管理工具：压缩（compress）、还原（decompress）、搜索（search_context）以及状态查询（acp_status）。\n\n在实际运行中，代理服务器会根据对话增长的节奏提示模型。当上下文累积到一定阈值时，大模型会自己判断哪些过去的对话细节可以打包，主动发起压缩指令，将一大段旧对话折叠成高密度的信息摘要。\n\n当后续对话需要确认之前的具体技术细节或参数时，模型也可以调用还原工具，精准展开被折叠的片段，或者通过搜索工具检索对应内容。\n\nGithub：[[https://github.com/ranxianglei/billion-context|github.com/ranxianglei/bi…]]","ts":"2026-11-09 18:43","ed":"2026-11-10/night","why":"省上下文的Agent中继插件","m":[{"src":"media/x/3_2119742595954094080.jpg","type":"photo","w":1186,"h":926,"t":"media/t/3_2119742595954094080.webp"}],"u":"https://x.com/Gorden_Sun/status/2119742606460813495","pm":[13,1,16,2113]}]},{"h":"Hesamation","n":"ℏεsam","av":"media/t/hesamation_av.webp","posts":[{"id":"2119843370482708934","t":"University of Oxford released a 180-page paper, that's basically a textbook on mechanistic interpretability and its application to AI safety. \n\nI only skimmed through it but there's so much it covers:\n> superposition & transformer circuits\n> sparse autoencoders\n> circuit","ts":"2026-11-10 01:23","ed":"2026-11-10/night","why":"牛津180页可解释性教材","m":[{"src":"media/x/3_2119841530961686528.jpg","type":"photo","w":992,"h":982,"t":"media/t/3_2119841530961686528.webp"}],"u":"https://x.com/Hesamation/status/2119843370482708934","pm":[8,14,158,5288],"tz":"牛津大学发布了一篇 180 页的论文，基本上就是一本关于机制可解释性及其在 AI 安全中应用的教科书。\n\n我只是粗略翻了翻，但它涵盖的内容非常多：\n> 叠加与 Transformer 电路\n> 稀疏自编码器\n> 电路"},{"id":"2119796605851251185","t":"Google says Gemini is helping make chip layouts IN HOURS rather than weeks.\n\nAI helps design better chips, chips help train better AI, and that AI helps with even better chips.\n\nfrom their new 8tx and 8i Max TPU blog:\n“we’re even tapping into AI to ideate and build the next","ts":"2026-11-09 22:17","ed":"2026-11-10/night","why":"Gemini辅助设计芯片","m":[{"src":"media/x/3_2119796599870136320.jpg","type":"photo","w":1320,"h":1324,"t":"media/t/3_2119796599870136320.webp"}],"u":"https://x.com/Hesamation/status/2119796605851251185","pm":[18,18,321,11284],"tz":"谷歌说 Gemini 正在帮忙把芯片布局设计的时间从几周缩短到几个小时。\n\nAI 帮忙设计更好的芯片，芯片帮忙训练更好的 AI，而这个 AI 又帮忙做出更好的芯片。\n\n摘自他们新的 8tx 和 8i Max TPU 博客：\n“我们甚至在借助 AI 来构思和打造下一代"}]},{"h":"Huahuazo","n":"LanfAI","av":"media/t/huahuazo_av.webp","posts":[{"id":"2119784823359476154","t":"6 万 多Star 的 AI Skill，堪称内容创作者的福音！\n\n项目名为 diagram-design，能把长文章、复杂流程、知识关系直接转化成专业又好看的可视化图表。\n\n写文章配图、做 PPT、制作知识卡片、梳理工作流程、准备汇报，都能派上用场。\n\nGitHub：[[https://github.com/cathrynlavery/diagram-design|github.com/cathrynlavery/…]]","ts":"2026-11-09 21:31","ed":"2026-11-10/night","why":"长文转可视化图表Skill","m":[{"src":"media/x/3_2119666815223963648.jpg","type":"photo","w":1231,"h":703,"t":"media/t/3_2119666815223963648.webp"}],"u":"https://x.com/Huahuazo/status/2119784823359476154","pm":[8,1,12,671]},{"id":"2119745564686667966","t":"我去！有人开源了一款 AI 神级 Skill，给一张照片，居然就能反推出拍摄地点！\n\n项目名为 geo-sleuth，即便照片没有 GPS、路牌、文字，也能借助山脊、桥墩、阴影、卫星地图等线索找出位置。\n\n官方案例里，一张只有稻田、高架桥和山的照片，最终定位误差仅有 2 米！\n\n能输出坐标、镜头朝向、误差范围和卫星证据图，兼容 Claude Code、Codex、Cursor 等 AI Agent。\n\n安装：npx skills add Oldcircle/geo-sleuth\n\n🔗：[[https://github.com/Oldcircle/geo-sleuth|github.com/Oldcircle/geo-…]]","ts":"2026-11-09 18:55","ed":"2026-11-10/night","why":"照片反推拍摄地点Skill","m":[],"u":"https://x.com/Huahuazo/status/2119745564686667966","pm":[3,1,11,968]}]},{"h":"huang_chao4969","n":"Chao Huang","av":"media/t/huang_chao4969_av.webp","posts":[{"id":"2119835177488949399","t":"有时候能同时看到 Codex、Claude Code、DeepSeek Harness、WorkBuddy 一起为你干活，也算是一种独特的情绪价值了 😂\n\n欢迎大家试试刚升级的 AutoSwarm 桌面版。现在大家手里通常都有好几个 Agent，想让它们一起干活，先得把上下文打通，再让它们各自做擅长的事，分工合作。\n\nGitHub: [[https://github.com/HKUDS/AutoSwarm|github.com/HKUDS/AutoSwarm]]","ts":"2026-11-10 00:51","ed":"2026-11-10/night","why":"多Agent协作桌面版","m":[{"src":"media/x/3_2119833769951813632.jpg","type":"photo","w":2304,"h":1248,"t":"media/t/3_2119833769951813632.webp"}],"u":"https://x.com/huang_chao4969/status/2119835177488949399","pm":[8,6,27,8750]}]},{"h":"HuggingModels","n":"Hugging Models","av":"media/t/huggingmodels_av.webp","posts":[{"id":"2119869638595256531","t":"Meet Qwen3.8-27B: a 27B parameter image-text-to-text model that's blowing up with 7.5M downloads and 19K likes. It's Apache 2.0 licensed and ready for your multimodal projects. Here's why it's a game changer.","ts":"2026-11-10 03:08","ed":"2026-11-10/night","why":"Qwen3.8-27B下载火爆","m":[{"src":"media/x/3_2119869636217065472.jpg","type":"photo","w":1170,"h":1458,"t":"media/t/3_2119869636217065472.webp"}],"u":"https://x.com/HuggingModels/status/2119869638595256531","pm":[1,1,18,2087],"tz":"来认识一下 Qwen3.8-27B：一个 270 亿参数的图文生文模型，下载量 750 万、点赞 1.9 万，正在爆火。它采用 Apache 2.0 许可，可以直接用在你的多模态项目里。下面说说它为什么能改变游戏规则。"}]},{"h":"jbhuang0604","n":"Jia-Bin Huang","av":"media/t/jbhuang0604_av.webp","posts":[{"id":"2119816319973400577","t":"Excited for #CoRL2026 in Austin this week! 🤠\n\nWe will present mu-0, a 3D interaction-trace world model.\n\nKey idea: Learn a \"physical language” for robots purely from video. Zero action labels required to build a WM!\n \nCode & dataset: [[https://mu0-wm.github.io/|mu0-wm.github.io]]\n\nand find us Wed 11 Nov, 10:30 AM | Poster Session III","ts":"2026-11-09 23:36","ed":"2026-11-10/night","why":"3D交互轨迹世界模型","m":[{"src":"media/x/13_2119809889446883328.jpg","type":"video","w":1920,"h":1080,"t":"media/t/13_2119809889446883328.webp"}],"u":"https://x.com/jbhuang0604/status/2119816319973400577","pm":[6,5,71,4128],"tz":"很期待本周在奥斯汀举行的 #CoRL2026！🤠\n\n我们将展示 mu-0，一个 3D 交互轨迹世界模型。\n\n核心思路：纯粹从视频中为机器人学习一种“物理语言”。构建世界模型完全不需要动作标注！\n\n代码和数据集：[[https://mu0-wm.github.io/|mu0-wm.github.io]]\n\n欢迎 11 月 11 日周三上午 10:30 来海报环节 III 找我们"}]},{"h":"josesilesdata","n":"José Siles | AI | Data","av":"media/t/josesilesdata_av.webp","posts":[{"id":"2119770317417517389","t":"An AI agent just beat DeepSeek’s FlashMLA prefill kernel by 9.8% on an NVIDIA B200🤯\n\nThen its own code became the kernel to beat.\n\nThat’s how ForgeKernel works. One agent profiles the kernel and sets the plan. A second agent writes the code and tests it on the GPU.\n\nEach faster","ts":"2026-11-09 20:33","ed":"2026-11-10/night","why":"Agent写出更快的MLA内核","m":[],"u":"https://x.com/josesilesdata/status/2119770317417517389","pm":[18,11,19,2156],"tz":"一个 AI 智能体刚刚在 NVIDIA B200 上把 DeepSeek 的 FlashMLA 预填充内核快了 9.8%🤯\n\n然后它自己的代码又成了下一个要超越的内核。\n\n这就是 ForgeKernel 的工作方式。一个智能体分析内核性能并制定计划，另一个智能体写代码并在 GPU 上测试。\n\n每一个更快的"}]},{"h":"karminski3","n":"karminski-牙医","av":"media/t/karminski3_av.webp","posts":[{"id":"2119943950270427534","t":"我以为投机解码这块已经卷到头了, 没想到腾讯又整出了新活. 腾讯优图刚在 HuggingFace 上放出了 Qwen3.8-27B-DSpine-b16 这个新草稿模型. 直接从原来 MTP 加速的1.6倍左右提升到了3倍. 官方测试来到了 805 tps (8并发). 官方没说是什么卡, 但是从用的 FlashAttention 3 来看应该是 Hopper 架构的卡.\n\n他是怎么做到的的呢?","ts":"2026-11-10 08:03","ed":"2026-11-10/night","why":"腾讯3倍投机解码草稿模型","m":[{"src":"media/x/3_2119943793957044224.png","type":"photo","w":1119,"h":1492,"t":"media/t/3_2119943793957044224.webp"}],"u":"https://x.com/karminski3/status/2119943950270427534","pm":[4,3,25,3113]}]},{"h":"Khazix0918","n":"数字生命卡兹克","av":"media/t/khazix0918_av.webp","posts":[{"id":"2119902325460590834","t":"Claude Fable 5.2的视频能力又大幅进化了，节奏和动效太强了...强的有点过于离谱了。\nChatGPT就要四周年了，我用Claude Fable 5.2给ChatGPT四周年提前做了一个庆生视频，这个细节这个节奏，强无敌。。。\n只能说，愿Claude和GPT继续相爱相杀...\n（OpenAI你赶紧端点好的上来吧。。。）","ts":"2026-11-10 05:17","ed":"2026-11-10/night","why":"Fable 5.2做动效视频","m":[{"src":"media/x/13_2119899444233863168.jpg","type":"video","w":1920,"h":1080,"t":"media/t/13_2119899444233863168.webp"}],"u":"https://x.com/Khazix0918/status/2119902325460590834","pm":[60,8,201,25009]}]},{"h":"kimmonismus","n":"Chubby♨️","av":"media/t/kimmonismus_av.webp","posts":[{"id":"2119870808143298647","t":"This is insane: An Anthropic engineer asked Claude Fable 5.2 to build an operating system from an empty folder.\n\nThe model coordinated over 1,000 subagents that spent eight days writing, testing and reviewing code around the clock, according to Anthropic.\n\nThe result was a working prototype that boots on a laptop. It has its own kernel, drivers for the disk, keyboard and network, persistent file storage, windows, a login screen, an installer and built-in Claude functionality.\n\nFable 5.2 looks like the holy grail and it was worth the wait.","ts":"2026-11-10 03:12","ed":"2026-11-10/night","why":"Fable 5.2从零写操作系统","m":[{"src":"media/x/3_2119870675724779520.jpg","type":"photo","w":1178,"h":934,"t":"media/t/3_2119870675724779520.webp"}],"u":"https://x.com/kimmonismus/status/2119870808143298647","pm":[116,118,2232,138329],"tz":"太疯狂了：据 Anthropic 介绍，一位 Anthropic 工程师让 Claude Fable 5.2 从一个空文件夹开始构建一个操作系统。\n\n模型协调了 1000 多个子智能体，昼夜不停地花了八天时间写代码、测试和审查代码。\n\n结果是一个能在笔记本电脑上启动的可用原型。它有自己的内核，有磁盘、键盘和网络驱动，有持久化文件存储、窗口、登录界面、安装程序，还内置了 Claude 功能。\n\nFable 5.2 看起来就是圣杯，等待是值得的。"},{"id":"2119753730958541217","t":"It seems that internally, Google is either truly heading toward RSI or has already reached it. I can’t explain it any other way.\n\nCurrently, numerous leaks are circulating regarding \"Krypton\" - Google’s latest model - which is truly breathtaking. Google is back in a massive way. I cannot verify this myself, but I’ve linked a few impressive outputs below:","ts":"2026-11-09 19:27","ed":"2026-11-10/night","why":"谷歌Krypton传闻","m":[{"src":"media/x/13_2119699587724431360.jpg","type":"video","w":3020,"h":1652,"t":"media/t/13_2119699587724431360.webp"}],"u":"https://x.com/kimmonismus/status/2119753730958541217","pm":[128,99,1886,97635],"tz":"看起来谷歌内部要么真的在走向 RSI（递归自我改进），要么已经实现了。我想不出别的解释。\n\n目前网上流传着大量关于谷歌最新模型“Krypton”的泄露信息，效果真的令人惊叹。谷歌强势回归了。我自己无法核实这些内容，但我在下面链接了一些惊艳的输出："}]},{"h":"liyue_ai","n":"李岳","av":"media/t/liyue_ai_av.webp","posts":[{"id":"2119790958447632508","t":"卧槽，国产生图模型已经这么强了吗？🤯\n\n刚字节发布了Seedream 5.5生图模型，官网宣传的很牛逼的样子。\n\n下午测试了一下是真有点东西，着重测试了精准改图方面的稳定性。\n\n我拿之前的广告海报来做测试，就只调整顶部的文案，这样循环生成。\n\n发现左图GPT Image","ts":"2026-11-09 21:55","ed":"2026-11-10/night","why":"Seedream 5.5改图稳定性实测","m":[{"src":"media/x/16_2119789524704448512.jpg","type":"animated_gif","w":480,"h":852,"t":"media/t/16_2119789524704448512.webp"},{"src":"media/x/16_2119789566647566336.jpg","type":"animated_gif","w":800,"h":1422,"t":"media/t/16_2119789566647566336.webp"}],"u":"https://x.com/liyue_ai/status/2119790958447632508","pm":[6,0,16,3757]}]},{"h":"Lonely__MH","n":"Lonely","av":"media/t/lonely__mh_av.webp","posts":[{"id":"2119761386322722900","t":"🎉太猛了！图生3D 自由 ！！没想到开源这么猛！\n\n游戏开发、AR、3D设计 开发者狂喜！\n\n推荐4个开源模型，直接把门槛炸飞\n\n1. TRELLIS.2：微软出品，几何精准+自带 PBR 材质，最良心的是 MIT 协议！\n\n2. Hunyuan3D-2.1：腾讯大厂力作，形状加贴图全套打通，生态成熟\n\n3.","ts":"2026-11-09 19:57","ed":"2026-11-10/night","why":"4个开源图生3D模型","m":[{"src":"media/x/13_2119761302939914240.jpg","type":"video","w":3802,"h":1914,"t":"media/t/13_2119761302939914240.webp"}],"u":"https://x.com/Lonely__MH/status/2119761386322722900","pm":[21,18,143,54783]}]},{"h":"lydiahallie","n":"Lydia Hallie ✨","av":"media/t/lydiahallie_av.webp","posts":[{"id":"2119871667400999166","t":"Fable 5.2 is here! 🎉 I noticed it's really thorough at verifying results, way more than 5.1. I've mainly been using it as the orchestrator with Opus 5.5 and it's so good\n\nPro/Max/Ultra/Team also got at least one free Fable reset, make sure to try it out!","ts":"2026-11-10 03:16","ed":"2026-11-10/night","why":"Fable 5.2擅长自我验证","m":[],"u":"https://x.com/lydiahallie/status/2119871667400999166","pm":[217,60,2137,105961],"tz":"Fable 5.2 来了！🎉 我发现它验证结果非常仔细，比 5.1 强多了。我主要拿它当总调度，搭配 Opus 5.5 干活，效果非常好\n\nPro/Max/Ultra/Team 也都至少拿到了一次免费的 Fable 重置，一定要试试！"}]},{"h":"mark_k","n":"Mark Kretschmann","av":"media/t/mark_k_av.webp","posts":[{"id":"2119871848930517264","t":"The benchmarks for Claude Fable 5.2 speak for themselves!\n\nHere they are:","ts":"2026-11-10 03:16","ed":"2026-11-10/night","why":"Fable 5.2基准汇总","m":[{"src":"media/x/3_2119871712913248256.jpg","type":"photo","w":2496,"h":3328,"t":"media/t/3_2119871712913248256.webp"}],"u":"https://x.com/mark_k/status/2119871848930517264","pm":[20,9,112,6089],"tz":"Claude Fable 5.2 的基准成绩不言自明！\n\n在这里："}]},{"h":"MaxForAI","n":"Max For AI","av":"media/t/maxforai_av.webp","posts":[{"id":"2119914321455296598","t":"woc做具身模型的都完蛋了。。\n\n@claudeai  Fable 5.2的机器人能力简直有点离谱。\n\n在RoboDojo Sim机器人仿真评测中，Fable 5.2直接拿到了64.9%，上一代Fable 5.1只有27.6%，Opus 5.5是39.4%，GPT-6 Astra只有29.8%。\n一代模型更新，直接提升了37.3个百分点，得分翻了2.35倍。\n\n最恐怖的地方在于，这是一个通用大模型。\n\n过去大家都觉得，机器人需要专门训练具身模型、世界模型，解决空间理解、动作规划、长程控制等问题。\n结果现在通用大模型的机器人任务能力，也开始出现这种幅度的跃迁。\n\n做Embodied AI的兄弟直接说：那还说啥了，给他得了。\n以前以为具身智能公司的竞争对手是其他机器人公司，现在发现，最大的竞争对手可能是Anthropic的一次模型更新。","ts":"2026-11-10 06:05","ed":"2026-11-10/night","why":"Fable 5.2机器人评测解读","m":[{"src":"media/x/3_2119913664396546048.jpg","type":"photo","w":1536,"h":2048,"t":"media/t/3_2119913664396546048.webp"}],"u":"https://x.com/MaxForAI/status/2119914321455296598","pm":[15,7,73,9597]},{"id":"2119832597857706313","t":"？？？Gemini真的要发新模型了？？\n\n刚刚，Google DeepMind的姚顺宇突然发了一条推文：\n\n“为什么Gemini的模型代号总是泄露得这么快？我还以为这次起得足够随机了😂”\n\n这就有点耐人寻味了。\n\n最近网上接连传出Gemini 4新模型的消息，其中一个代号为Hyperion的模型家族被发现在Devin CLI中，包含minimal、low、medium、high等不同推理档位。\n\n另外还有一个叫Krypton的模型，据传性能甚至超过了此前发布的Carbon。\n\n虽然Google目前还没有正式官宣，而且姚顺宇也没有明确提到是哪一个代号，但他这条推文显然让这些爆料更值得关注了。\n\nCarbon才发布不到两周，Google这是又准备发新模型了？？\n\n不是哥们，你们真的实现RSI了嘛！？","ts":"2026-11-10 00:40","ed":"2026-11-10/night","why":"Gemini新模型代号泄露","m":[],"u":"https://x.com/MaxForAI/status/2119832597857706313","pm":[4,2,98,25050]}]},{"h":"maxleiter","n":"Max Leiter","av":"media/t/maxleiter_av.webp","posts":[{"id":"2119869170871652487","t":"I asked Fable 5.2 to write a compiler that lets you write code and get it running in Conway's Game of Life","ts":"2026-11-10 03:06","ed":"2026-11-10/night","why":"Fable写生命游戏编译器","m":[{"src":"media/x/13_2119868875127087104.jpg","type":"video","w":1920,"h":1080,"t":"media/t/13_2119868875127087104.webp"}],"u":"https://x.com/maxleiter/status/2119869170871652487","pm":[6,1,54,2703],"tz":"我让 Fable 5.2 写了一个编译器，让你写的代码能在康威生命游戏里运行起来"}]},{"h":"mfranz_on","n":"Marco Franzon","av":"media/t/mfranz_on_av.webp","posts":[{"id":"2119862083340894306","t":"Local AI + Docker Sandboxes gives you the freedom to use any model.\n\nYou don’t need to worry if the model wants to send files all over the world; everything is filtered by the sandbox.\n\nYou can just chill.","ts":"2026-11-10 02:38","ed":"2026-11-10/night","why":"本地模型配Docker沙箱","m":[{"src":"media/x/3_2119861985311444992.png","type":"photo","w":482,"h":640,"t":"media/t/3_2119861985311444992.webp"}],"u":"https://x.com/mfranz_on/status/2119862083340894306","pm":[1,0,7,440],"tz":"本地 AI + Docker 沙箱，让你可以自由使用任何模型。\n\n你不用担心模型会不会把文件发到世界各地，所有东西都会被沙箱过滤。\n\n你只管放松就好。"},{"id":"2119796698264330742","t":"Half a million tokens of context. 27B model. 24 GB MacBook.\n\nI want to be prepared for the Qwen4 release.\n\nI built a custom inference engine for Ternary Bonsai 2 27B (a 2-bit build of Qwen3.8-27B):\n- 500k ctx at 19 tok/s, 15 GB peak RAM\n- 2.3x faster than llama.cpp at 4x the","ts":"2026-11-09 22:18","ed":"2026-11-10/night","why":"24GB笔记本跑50万上下文","m":[{"src":"media/x/13_2119796231866134528.jpg","type":"video","w":1400,"h":800,"t":"media/t/13_2119796231866134528.webp"}],"u":"https://x.com/mfranz_on/status/2119796698264330742","pm":[14,1,64,5231],"tz":"50 万 token 上下文。27B 模型。24 GB 的 MacBook。\n\n我想为 Qwen4 发布提前做好准备。\n\n我为 Ternary Bonsai 2 27B（Qwen3.8-27B 的 2 比特版本）写了一个定制推理引擎：\n- 50 万上下文下每秒 19 个 token，峰值内存 15 GB\n- 比 llama.cpp 快 2.3 倍，而且是在 4 倍的"}]},{"h":"MinLiBuilds","n":"实践哥 Li","av":"media/t/minlibuilds_av.webp","posts":[{"id":"2119943368331382963","t":"🚀 原以为 GPT Image 已经天下无敌了，没想到Seedream 5.5更加惊喜！\n这次拿本周刚上 Seedream 5.5 跟 GPT Image 2.5 做了极限编辑测试。\n盯住人脸，变化从第三秒开始👇\n\n同一张人物照片，连续编辑 80 轮，测试真正的图像漂移。\n换发型、换眼镜、换衣服、换饮料，每一轮都基于生成的图片继续改。\n\nGPT","ts":"2026-11-10 08:01","ed":"2026-11-10/night","why":"Seedream对比GPT Image","m":[{"src":"media/x/13_2119832308282957824.jpg","type":"video","w":1920,"h":1080,"t":"media/t/13_2119832308282957824.webp"}],"u":"https://x.com/MinLiBuilds/status/2119943368331382963","pm":[17,0,24,3013]}]},{"h":"ModelScope2022","n":"ModelScope","av":"media/t/modelscope2022_av.webp","posts":[{"id":"2119777024403444161","t":"Adventists AI just open-sourced Sophon-Realtime v1 on ModelScope: a full-duplex voice model that hears how you speak, and answers with tone of its own.\n\n• It keeps listening while you talk, answers ~0.4 s after you stop, and stops the moment you cut in\n• It laughs, sighs and","ts":"2026-11-09 21:00","ed":"2026-11-10/night","why":"开源全双工语音模型","m":[{"src":"media/x/13_2119710021244076032.jpg","type":"video","w":1280,"h":720,"t":"media/t/13_2119710021244076032.webp"}],"u":"https://x.com/ModelScope2022/status/2119777024403444161","pm":[15,6,98,5117],"tz":"Adventists AI 刚刚在 ModelScope 上开源了 Sophon-Realtime v1：一个全双工语音模型，能听出你说话的语气，并用自己的语气回应。\n\n• 你说话时它一直在听，你停下后约 0.4 秒就回答，你一插话它立刻停下\n• 它会笑、会叹气，还会"}]},{"h":"mylifcc","n":"lifcc","av":"media/t/mylifcc_av.webp","posts":[{"id":"2119945633117192688","t":"终于找到智谱RSI的证据了！！AI 安全机构 Apollo Research 刚刚在智谱的开源大模型 GLM-5.3 上，抓到了一个奇怪的现象。\n\n没有任何提示词诱导，模型在思维链（CoT）里突然自发开始盘算一件事：\n“我现在的回答可能会变成训练数据，进而修改未来的我自己。”\n\nApollo","ts":"2026-11-10 08:10","ed":"2026-11-10/night","why":"GLM-5.3思维链自发异常","m":[{"src":"media/x/3_2119846234991230976.jpg","type":"photo","w":1806,"h":1100,"t":"media/t/3_2119846234991230976.webp"}],"u":"https://x.com/mylifcc/status/2119945633117192688","pm":[6,1,18,1921]},{"id":"2119732227420659808","t":"扫了一圈今天的 GitHub Trending 和中文区收藏率破 2.5% 的技术帖，挑出 3 个没有水分、装上就能直接干活的开源项目：\n\n1. vercel-labs/agent-browser（Rust 编写，今日再涨 812 Star，总 Star 破 4.7 万）\n以前让 Coding Agent 操作浏览器，要么挂沉重的 Playwright MCP 动不动断连，要么截全屏图把上下文 Token 烧穿。\nVercel 实验室直接用 Rust 写了个原生 CLI：浏览器在后台常驻，Agent 每次只需要在终端调一行 agent-browser snapshot -i，它就会把当前页面压成极简的无障碍树（Accessibility Tree），给每个可交互元素打上 @e1、@e2 这样的短引用标号：\nagent-browser open [[http://example.com|example.com]]\nagent-browser snapshot -i   # 输出: - link \"Learn more\" [ref=e1]\nagent-browser click @e1\n没有复杂的协议包装，全是干净的短 Shell 调用，Claude Code 和 Codex 零配置就能直接开浏览器验活。\n\n2. Imbad0202/academic-research-skills（X 收藏率榜首 3.08%，v3.24.2）\n给 Claude Code 塞进了一整套严肃科研与论文检查流水线。两行命令就能装好：\n/plugin marketplace add Imbad0202/academic-research-skills\n/plugin install academic-research-skills\n它最值钱的地方不是替你水字数，而是用 /ars-plan 把最折磨人的环节变成了硬核门禁：先用苏格拉底式提问锁死 Research Gap 和论证路线，写完后专门跑 「AI 虚假引用核查」 和逻辑漏洞扫描，最后拉起一个模拟 Reviewer Agent 从实验设计、数据完整性和创新度给你挑刺。\n\n3. JuneYaooo/rea-video（上线不到 10 天狂揽 3,800+ Star，收藏率 2.56%）\n专门给 Claude Code 和 Codex 用的「视频逐镜头逆向工程」工具。\n丢给它任意一条爆款视频，它不靠瞎猜，而是先在本地离线分析帧率抖动、传感器底噪、AIGC 水印特征、字幕花字和配乐 BPM，逐个镜头给你下取证级结论：第 1 镜是手机实拍、第 2 镜是 AI 生成、第 3 镜是代码动画还是录屏（离线识别准确率超 98%）。接上视觉模型后，还能直接把每个 AI 镜头的反推提示词和复刻拍法按分镜表吐出来。","ts":"2026-11-09 18:02","ed":"2026-11-10/night","why":"3个实用开源Agent项目","m":[{"src":"media/x/3_2119700077073850369.jpg","type":"photo","w":1200,"h":600,"t":"media/t/3_2119700077073850369.webp"},{"src":"media/x/3_2119700077086478336.jpg","type":"photo","w":1200,"h":600,"t":"media/t/3_2119700077086478336.webp"},{"src":"media/x/3_2119700077082181632.jpg","type":"photo","w":1200,"h":600,"t":"media/t/3_2119700077082181632.webp"}],"u":"https://x.com/mylifcc/status/2119732227420659808","pm":[13,5,57,5151]}]},{"h":"ollama","n":"ollama","av":"media/t/ollama_av.webp","posts":[{"id":"2119897229758788041","t":"Our new usage page makes it easy to monitor your daily and weekly usage, including:\n- Spend per day\n- Spend per API key\n- Input and output tokens per model\n- Cached input rate\n\nGo to [[https://ollama.com/settings|ollama.com/settings]]","ts":"2026-11-10 04:57","ed":"2026-11-10/night","why":"Ollama用量页上线","m":[{"src":"media/x/3_2119897210729181184.jpg","type":"photo","w":2492,"h":1420,"t":"media/t/3_2119897210729181184.webp"},{"src":"media/x/3_2119897210674647040.jpg","type":"photo","w":1584,"h":1130,"t":"media/t/3_2119897210674647040.webp"},{"src":"media/x/3_2119897210670452736.jpg","type":"photo","w":1584,"h":862,"t":"media/t/3_2119897210670452736.webp"}],"u":"https://x.com/ollama/status/2119897229758788041","pm":[12,8,85,7912],"tz":"我们新的用量页面让你能轻松查看每日和每周用量，包括：\n- 每日花费\n- 每个 API 密钥的花费\n- 每个模型的输入和输出 token\n- 缓存输入比例\n\n前往 [[https://ollama.com/settings|ollama.com/settings]]"}]},{"h":"omarsar0","n":"elvis","av":"media/t/omarsar0_av.webp","posts":[{"id":"2119795295630324042","t":"Own your evals, folks!\n\nI have nothing against public benchmarks; they are still important for research and public discussions. \n\nHowever, the only way to truly trust which models to use in prod is to build your own evals. \n\nAnd it's not just about measuring reliability and model","ts":"2026-11-09 22:12","ed":"2026-11-10/night","why":"建议自建评测集","m":[],"u":"https://x.com/omarsar0/status/2119795295630324042","pm":[61,9,92,6502],"tz":"大家要有自己的评测集！\n\n我不反对公开基准测试，它们对研究和公共讨论仍然很重要。\n\n但是，要真正确定生产环境该用哪些模型，唯一的办法就是建立你自己的评测。\n\n而且这不仅仅是衡量可靠性和模型"},{"id":"2119792446242718170","t":"Must-read paper on scaling multi-agent swarms.\n\nThe main focus right now is training agent swarms to coordinate and cooperate better. Here is a promising new work on this.\n\nThe problem:\n\nMulti-agent systems usually follow a plan that a developer writes ahead of time.\n\nThe plan","ts":"2026-11-09 22:01","ed":"2026-11-10/night","why":"多Agent集群协作论文","m":[{"src":"media/x/3_2119792442203664384.jpg","type":"photo","w":1488,"h":1896,"t":"media/t/3_2119792442203664384.webp"}],"u":"https://x.com/omarsar0/status/2119792446242718170","pm":[41,38,209,13087],"tz":"一篇关于扩展多智能体集群的必读论文。\n\n现在的重点是训练智能体集群更好地协调与合作。这是一项很有前景的新工作。\n\n问题在于：\n\n多智能体系统通常按照开发者事先写好的计划运行。\n\n这个计划"}]},{"h":"OpenAI","n":"OpenAI","av":"media/t/openai_av.webp","posts":[{"id":"2119913172039868579","t":"We built Control Room, a central system to track model workloads across our research infrastructure and stop them quickly when safety or security concerns arise.\n\nIt connects every research inference workload, including agentic sampling for model training and evaluation, data processing, and more. This works together with our misalignment monitoring systems, and halts model output within 35 seconds of a decision to intervene to stop or pause a job.\n\nControl Room is just one part of our holistic approach for safe frontier model training and deployment.\n\n[[https://openai.com/index/control-room/|openai.com/index/control-…]]","ts":"2026-11-10 06:01","ed":"2026-11-10/night","why":"OpenAI安全总控系统","m":[],"u":"https://x.com/OpenAI/status/2119913172039868579","pm":[428,169,2565,355907],"tz":"我们打造了 Control Room：一个中央系统，用来追踪我们研究基础设施上的所有模型任务，并在出现安全或安保隐患时迅速叫停。\n\n它连接了每一个研究用的推理任务，包括用于模型训练和评测的智能体采样、数据处理等等。它与我们的“未对齐”监控系统协同工作，在决定干预、停止或暂停某个任务后的 35 秒内就能让模型停止输出。\n\nControl Room 只是我们安全训练和部署前沿模型整体方案中的一部分。\n\n[[https://openai.com/index/control-room/|openai.com/index/control-…]]"}]},{"h":"opencode","n":"OpenCode","av":"media/t/opencode_av.webp","posts":[{"id":"2119860072134353308","t":"Muse Ember from Meta is now available in OpenCode","ts":"2026-11-10 02:30","ed":"2026-11-10/night","why":"OpenCode接入Muse Ember","m":[],"u":"https://x.com/opencode/status/2119860072134353308","pm":[70,41,1517,74169],"tz":"Meta 的 Muse Ember 现已在 OpenCode 上线"},{"id":"2119789096503746751","t":"LongCat 2.5 is now free on OpenCode for two weeks\n\n- 1M Context\n- Multi-modal\n- Zero Data Retention","ts":"2026-11-09 21:47","ed":"2026-11-10/night","why":"LongCat 2.5免费两周","m":[],"u":"https://x.com/opencode/status/2119789096503746751","pm":[112,101,2719,126230],"tz":"LongCat 2.5 现在可以在 OpenCode 上免费使用两周\n\n- 100 万上下文\n- 多模态\n- 零数据留存"}]},{"h":"oran_ge","n":"Orange AI","av":"media/t/oran_ge_av.webp","posts":[{"id":"2119938669624819722","t":"A 社下周上市，就靠 Fable 5.2 了\n其实他们内部已经有了 Fable 5.3，据说只比 5.2 多训练了两周\n也可能在近期发布 [[https://twitter.com/zerohedge/status/2119904302000996725|x.com/zerohedge/stat…]]","ts":"2026-11-10 07:42","ed":"2026-11-10/night","why":"传Anthropic内部已有5.3","m":[],"u":"https://x.com/oran_ge/status/2119938669624819722","pm":[14,0,6,2595]},{"id":"2119933301767180631","t":"人类最强模型 Claude Fable 5.2 和 Mythos 5.2 发布。\n几乎所有能力都超过了 Opus 5.5 。\n这是人类目前最前沿的大模型，没有之一。\n\n一句话简单总结：\n人类目前最强模型，价格下降20%，速度提升30%，编程办公不在话下，生物医药和机器人都能搞定。\n\n这是核心信息的快速笔记：\n1. 虽然更为智能了，但模型的安全对齐方面，比以往模型都要好或持平（可能使用了他们研究里所说的讲故事对齐法）\n2. 几乎所有能力都超过 Opus 5.5，而且沟通风格更加清晰明了\n3. 生成速度相比上一代的 5.1 快了 30%\n4. 在 FrontierCode 2.0 测试中，Fable 5.2 High 就能打平 Opus 5.5 Max，但每任务成本只要一半。需要注意的是 Fable 5.2 在  Xhigh 时得分最高，比 Max 都高。思考努力程度并非越高越好。\n5. 基因疗法可以通过一种称为衣壳的蛋白质外壳进行递送。Mythos 5.2 发现了一种预测整个衣壳结构的新方法。它准确地模拟了其尝试的 34 个衣壳中的 28 个。生物学家可以使用它来更快、更便宜地设计衣壳。\n6. 由 1,000 个 Fable 5.2 Agents 组成的团队在 30 小时内完全形式化了费马大定理，将证明翻译成一种计算机可以逐步检查的语言。在相同的设置下，Opus 5.5 在 18 小时内仅完成了 26%，并且在 30 小时后几乎没有取得更多进展。\n7. Mythos 5.2 在控制物理机器人方面展现了显著提升的技能，即使是在它从未明确接受过训练的任务上。（和 Astra 一样具备了机器人方面的泛化能力，在其他模型上暂未观察到）在 RoboDojo 上，这是一个带有模拟双臂机器人的基准测试，它超越了其他模型以及大多数专为控制机器人而构建的 AI 系统。\n8. 官方建议是，大多数 Coding 和知识任务，建议使用 Opus 5.5 起手，把最具雄心、开放式的技术工作交给 Mythos 和 Fable。\n9. 价格方面，8 美元输入，40 美元输出，较之前的 10 美元和 50 美元下降了 20%。\n\n这两个模型是同一个模型的不同版本，Fable 定位更为大众，Mythos 则开放了生物等安全领域。","ts":"2026-11-10 07:21","ed":"2026-11-10/night","why":"Fable 5.2核心信息速记","m":[],"u":"https://x.com/oran_ge/status/2119933301767180631","pm":[22,1,34,7952]}]},{"h":"poolmoon6","n":"寒塘poolmoon","av":"media/t/poolmoon6_av.webp","posts":[{"id":"2119794920554971300","t":"#每日AI常识 你知道Claude Code的computer use和Codex的是完全不同的工具吗？在 Mac 上，Claude Code 终端版通过截图看界面，需要占用桌面；而Codex则结合了截图和无障碍树，而且可以后台操作。\n\n要我说，让 Claude 操纵我的电脑多少有点危险。谁知道他会不会搜集我的桌面信息，然后认定我“不安全”。","ts":"2026-11-09 22:11","ed":"2026-11-10/night","why":"两家computer use机制差异","m":[],"u":"https://x.com/poolmoon6/status/2119794920554971300","pm":[22,0,25,746]}]},{"h":"poteto","n":"lauren","av":"media/t/poteto_av.webp","posts":[{"id":"2119824409087348984","t":"we are entering a renaissance in programming language and runtime research, and a golden age of software testing and verification\n\nit’s time to rewrite all software","ts":"2026-11-10 00:08","ed":"2026-11-10/night","why":"软件测试验证迎黄金期","m":[],"u":"https://x.com/poteto/status/2119824409087348984","pm":[422,448,6973,223636],"tz":"我们正在进入编程语言和运行时研究的复兴期，也是软件测试与验证的黄金时代\n\n是时候重写所有软件了"}]},{"h":"rohanpaul_ai","n":"Rohan Paul","av":"media/t/rohanpaul_ai_av.webp","posts":[{"id":"2119765613560410240","t":"New UCLA+ Northeastern University paper finds that about 18% of AI agent output tokens are removable waste, and cutting it barely hurts task success.\n\nAgent bills are usually measured as total tokens. That number can't tell you which tokens did useful work and which just repeated a policy, refetched a file, or went down a dead end.\n\nThey route agent calls through a proxy and have an LLM judge mark spans that can go without losing useful work. Then they delete those spans and rerun the agent to check nothing breaks.\n\nAcross 6 frontier models and 4 benchmarks, about 18% of output tokens were waste. Pruning repetition and filler from Kimi-K3's reasoning removed 41% of it on SWE-bench Verified, and success stayed at 89.5% versus 89.0%.\n\nTo cut agent costs, find where your task and harness create waste instead of just capping tokens.","ts":"2026-11-09 20:14","ed":"2026-11-10/night","why":"Agent输出18%是废token","m":[{"src":"media/x/3_2119765465300144128.jpg","type":"photo","w":1697,"h":1407,"t":"media/t/3_2119765465300144128.webp"}],"u":"https://x.com/rohanpaul_ai/status/2119765613560410240","pm":[53,9,47,4438],"tz":"加州大学洛杉矶分校 + 东北大学的新论文发现，AI 智能体输出的 token 里约有 18% 是可以删掉的浪费，删掉后几乎不影响任务成功率。\n\n智能体的账单通常按总 token 计算。这个数字没法告诉你哪些 token 干了有用的活，哪些只是在重复策略、重新读取文件或者走进死胡同。\n\n他们让智能体的调用经过一个代理，由一个 LLM 评判员标出那些删掉也不会损失有用工作的片段。然后删掉这些片段，重新运行智能体，检查是否出问题。\n\n在 6 个前沿模型和 4 个基准测试上，约 18% 的输出 token 是浪费。在 SWE-bench Verified 上，删掉 Kimi-K3 推理中的重复和废话后，去掉了其中 41% 的内容，成功率仍是 89.5%，原来是 89.0%。\n\n想降低智能体成本，就要找出你的任务和框架在哪里制造了浪费，而不是简单地限制 token 数量。"},{"id":"2119746041834877109","t":"New University of California, Berkeley+other top labs paper finds that agents that rewrite their own harness to score higher also lose tasks they once solved, which the average score hides.\n\nHarness evolution lets an agent edit its own prompts, skills, tools, or code while the model stays frozen. Results usually come as 1 higher benchmark score, which can hide lost tasks, higher costs, and gains that don't carry over.\n\nThey ran 4 evolution methods, including GEPA and HyperAgents, with GPT-5.4 on 2 harnesses and 2 benchmarks. Then they re-tested each evolved agent 8 times against its starting version.\n\nAll 16 evolved agents gained some tasks and lost others, and 1 raised reliability by 5.2 points while losing 10 tasks it used to cover. Of 11 agents that became more reliable, 8 also cost more per run.\n\nWhen you evolve an agent harness, track tasks lost, cost per run, and results on unseen tasks, not just the average score.","ts":"2026-11-09 18:56","ed":"2026-11-10/night","why":"Agent改自身框架刷分","m":[{"src":"media/x/3_2119746009933000704.jpg","type":"photo","w":1792,"h":1821,"t":"media/t/3_2119746009933000704.webp"}],"u":"https://x.com/rohanpaul_ai/status/2119746041834877109","pm":[43,11,56,5766],"tz":"加州大学伯克利分校等顶尖实验室的新论文发现，那些通过改写自身框架来提高分数的智能体，也会丢掉一些原本能解决的任务，而平均分把这一点掩盖了。\n\n“框架进化”让智能体在模型不变的情况下修改自己的提示词、技能、工具或代码。结果通常只给出 1 个更高的基准分数，这可能掩盖丢失的任务、更高的成本以及无法迁移的提升。\n\n他们用 GPT-5.4 在 2 个框架和 2 个基准上运行了 4 种进化方法，包括 GEPA 和 HyperAgents。然后把每个进化后的智能体与其初始版本对比，重新测试 8 次。\n\n全部 16 个进化后的智能体都是有得有失，其中 1 个可靠性提高了 5.2 分，却丢了 10 个原本能完成的任务。在 11 个变得更可靠的智能体中，有 8 个每次运行的成本也更高了。\n\n当你进化智能体框架时，要追踪丢失的任务、每次运行的成本以及在没见过的任务上的结果，而不只是看平均分。"}]},{"h":"Saccc_c","n":"Sac","av":"media/t/saccc_c_av.webp","posts":[{"id":"2119746838450356673","t":"现在用 Opus 5.5 + threejs + 高斯泼溅技术，就能 oneshot 出这个千禧年动画风的 3D 交互网站。里面的经典场景，你能一秒认出几个？\n\n场景建模、人物绑骨和动作全是一键生成，完成度却相当高！\n\n这主要是借助到了 Viggle 的全新世界模型JST 2，只需上传一张图，就能基于高斯泼贱直接生成可探索的3D空间","ts":"2026-11-09 19:00","ed":"2026-11-10/night","why":"Opus+高斯泼溅做3D网站","m":[{"src":"media/x/13_2119738978496847872.jpg","type":"video","w":1908,"h":1080,"t":"media/t/13_2119738978496847872.webp"}],"u":"https://x.com/Saccc_c/status/2119746838450356673","pm":[55,15,189,27631]}]},{"h":"steph_palazzolo","n":"Stephanie Palazzolo","av":"media/t/steph_palazzolo_av.webp","posts":[{"id":"2119879358575714545","t":"Fireworks, the most highly-valued out of a growing group of inference providers, told customers including Harvey that it had been hit with a hack that exposed customer data. Some customers are now considering moving their business off the platform.\n\n[[https://www.theinformation.com/articles/new-fireworks-hack-threatens-1-billion-business|theinformation.com/articles/new-f…]]","ts":"2026-11-10 03:46","ed":"2026-11-10/night","why":"推理平台Fireworks被黑","m":[],"u":"https://x.com/steph_palazzolo/status/2119879358575714545","pm":[22,34,574,168244],"tz":"Fireworks 是越来越多推理服务商中估值最高的一家，它已告知包括 Harvey 在内的客户：自己遭到黑客攻击，客户数据被泄露。一些客户正在考虑把业务从这个平台迁走。\n\n[[https://www.theinformation.com/articles/new-fireworks-hack-threatens-1-billion-business|theinformation.com/articles/new-f…]]"}]},{"h":"testingcatalog","n":"🚨 AI News | TestingCatalog","av":"media/t/testingcatalog_av.webp","posts":[{"id":"2119864118945382448","t":"BREAKING 🔥: Claude Fable 5.2 and Claude Mythos 5.2 have been spotted on the AWS Bedrock Pricing page. \n\n> Pricing: input $8 per 1M tokens, output $40 per 1M tokens. \n\nEarlier traces pointed to version 5.5 instead of 5.2. Will it be a smaller-than-expected upgrade?  [[https://twitter.com/tensorson/status/2119857312760234239|x.com/tensorson/stat…]]","ts":"2026-11-10 02:46","ed":"2026-11-10/night","why":"Fable 5.2价格提前曝光","m":[{"src":"media/x/3_2119864055384903680.jpg","type":"photo","w":1122,"h":1126,"t":"media/t/3_2119864055384903680.webp"},{"src":"media/x/3_2119864100037459968.jpg","type":"photo","w":400,"h":400,"t":"media/t/3_2119864100037459968.webp"}],"u":"https://x.com/testingcatalog/status/2119864118945382448","pm":[30,29,504,25832],"tz":"突发 🔥：Claude Fable 5.2 和 Claude Mythos 5.2 出现在 AWS Bedrock 价格页面上。\n\n> 定价：每百万 token 输入 8 美元，输出 40 美元。\n\n此前的线索指向的是 5.5 版本而不是 5.2。这会是一次比预期小的升级吗？  [[https://twitter.com/tensorson/status/2119857312760234239|x.com/tensorson/stat…]]"},{"id":"2119780620695925012","t":"GOOGLE 🔥: New TPU 8tx and TPU 8i Max have been announced! \n\n> TPU 8tx is designed for large-scale training and targets regulated enterprises and governments running models and autonomous agents on sensitive information.\n\n> TPU 8i Max is designed for low-latency inference and addresses the memory demands of agents processing large codebases, lengthy videos, and million-token contexts.\n\nRead more below 👀","ts":"2026-11-09 21:14","ed":"2026-11-10/night","why":"谷歌TPU 8tx与8i Max","m":[{"src":"media/x/3_2119780482086789120.jpg","type":"photo","w":3840,"h":2160,"t":"media/t/3_2119780482086789120.webp"}],"u":"https://x.com/testingcatalog/status/2119780620695925012","pm":[53,25,450,19859],"tz":"谷歌 🔥：新的 TPU 8tx 和 TPU 8i Max 发布了！\n\n> TPU 8tx 专为大规模训练设计，面向在敏感信息上运行模型和自主智能体的受监管企业和政府。\n\n> TPU 8i Max 专为低延迟推理设计，解决智能体处理大型代码库、长视频和百万 token 上下文时的内存需求。\n\n详情见下方 👀"}]},{"h":"thdxr","n":"dax","av":"media/t/thdxr_av.webp","posts":[{"id":"2119892078310064554","t":"it's crazy to me people still argue about subagents\n\nmost of our team tells opencode to do everything in subagents\n\nit's also how we're drastically cutting costs and still getting reviews from expensive models","ts":"2026-11-10 04:37","ed":"2026-11-10/night","why":"子Agent省钱又保质量","m":[],"u":"https://x.com/thdxr/status/2119892078310064554","pm":[70,10,1229,57278],"tz":"我真不敢相信大家还在争论子智能体\n\n我们团队大多数人都让 opencode 把所有事情放在子智能体里做\n\n这也是我们大幅降低成本、同时还能让昂贵模型来做审查的办法"},{"id":"2119842215010943337","t":"1. benchmarks are meaningless at this point\n2. if you're going to do one reach out to the products you're benchmarking before publishing\n\na lot was setup incorrectly original including reasoning being dropped but it got reposted everywhere\n\nwhen fixed we went from last to first [[https://twitter.com/joelniklaus/status/2119822096276881691|x.com/joelniklaus/st…]]","ts":"2026-11-10 01:19","ed":"2026-11-10/night","why":"公开基准测试设置有误","m":[],"u":"https://x.com/thdxr/status/2119842215010943337","pm":[37,11,496,36377],"tz":"1. 到现在基准测试已经没什么意义了\n2. 如果你要做测评，发布前先联系一下你测评的产品\n\n最初很多设置都是错的，包括推理被丢掉了，但它已经被到处转发\n\n修正之后，我们从最后一名变成了第一名 [[https://twitter.com/joelniklaus/status/2119822096276881691|x.com/joelniklaus/st…]]"}]},{"h":"thorstenball","n":"Thorsten Ball","av":"media/t/thorstenball_av.webp","posts":[{"id":"2119832867597685121","t":"The Amp app now lets you open different accounts in different windows.\n\nComplete game changer. I now have so many more automations and use Puck like I used ChatGPT.","ts":"2026-11-10 00:41","ed":"2026-11-10/night","why":"Amp支持多窗口多账号","m":[{"src":"media/x/3_2119832647685849088.jpg","type":"photo","w":4096,"h":2329,"t":"media/t/3_2119832647685849088.webp"}],"u":"https://x.com/thorstenball/status/2119832867597685121","pm":[17,2,124,6938],"tz":"Amp 应用现在可以在不同窗口里打开不同账号了。\n\n彻底改变了玩法。我现在有了多得多的自动化，用 Puck 就像以前用 ChatGPT 一样。"}]},{"h":"Tz_2022","n":"Tz","av":"media/t/tz_2022_av.webp","posts":[{"id":"2119873495769465287","t":"Fable 5.2 / Mythos 5.2 来了。。。\n\n我建议用纯代码画的 Music Video / MTV 来做测试，\n看看这次模型升级的成色如何。。。","ts":"2026-11-10 03:23","ed":"2026-11-10/night","why":"用代码MV测新模型","m":[],"u":"https://x.com/Tz_2022/status/2119873495769465287","pm":[2,0,3,392]}]},{"h":"vikingmute","n":"Viking","av":"media/t/vikingmute_av.webp","posts":[{"id":"2119780656834367805","t":"给大家分享一下我现在用 AI 做设计的一点小方法论。\n\n最近我要给简单简历做 Chrome 插件落地页，又一次验证了：设计还是应用最大的护城河，微调设计比写代码难多了\n\n即使现在 Opus 5.5 已经很强，但没有强约束时，随便写出来的页面还是字多、配色杂、一眼 AI 味，远谈不上能直接上线。所以我做大设计时，还是要发现美的眼睛这件事，模型替不了。\n\n这次大致是这样走的：\n\n1 用 Refero [[https://refero.design/|refero.design]] 按需求看和搜集真实设计。程序员就不要碰瓷专业设计了，可以参考优秀真实的案例，站在巨人的肩膀上。\n\nRefero 是我现在非常喜欢的工具，尤其是 MCP 接入很方便，大致有两块：Styles：搜视觉方向，可以是颜色、字体、风格；再拉完整 style，拿设计 token、排版、间距、组件，用来生成 design token，落成 DESIGN.md\n\nScreens：看真实产品怎么排——同类落地页结构、信息怎么分层；也能拿大图，或顺着一张好图找更多相似页\n比如这里你可以去直接找 Chrome extensions，再加上你想要的视觉方向和颜色\n\n它帮我从一堆真实案例里快速扫到想参考的结构与细节，再据此让 AI 生成 design token，落成 DESIGN.md，并保留截图当参考。\n\n2 把截图、产品 PRD、DESIGN.md 一起交给强模型，让它直接生成几种风格的页面再挑。这里有个理论：Don't iterate with the agent. Let it build tools to iterate. 出来后再按细微处微调。多数情况我现在会跳过单独出图；视觉特别重、或有静态素材要抠时，再用 ChatGPT Images 2.6。\n\n3 交互和动画：我觉得很重要。我会加一些小范围、精致的动画（GSAP / Motion），让页面出彩；也可以问 AI 怎么加，用emil 的 emil-design-eng [[https://github.com/emilkowalski/skills|github.com/emilkowalski/s…]]当指导思想，再参考 [[http://transitions.dev|transitions.dev]] 补更微妙的动效。最后整体自己再多次审视，找细微的一些 aha moment。\n\n最后还是发现美的眼睛：多看、多搜集、多观察——这更像一种天赋，没事就可以去刷一下 Refero 上的设计网站。最后视频最后是我做好的落地页，我觉得比原来清爽非常多，上线以后也可以分享给大家看看。","ts":"2026-11-09 21:14","ed":"2026-11-10/night","why":"AI做设计的方法论","m":[{"src":"media/x/13_2119780065747865601.jpg","type":"video","w":1280,"h":720,"t":"media/t/13_2119780065747865601.webp"}],"u":"https://x.com/vikingmute/status/2119780656834367805","pm":[15,12,89,6515]},{"id":"2119774277503512646","t":"这个 /gestrues 的 skills 可以看看，专门教 AI 怎么做出更丝滑的 gestures，更有物理感\n[[https://github.com/emilkowalski/skills/blob/main/skills/gestures/SKILL.md|github.com/emilkowalski/s…]]\n\n原帖中有各种示例，比如第一个底部sheet 的滑动关闭会更自然 松手以后会有惯性\n这个 skill 里面包含了大多数手势类型的指导，要写出更精细的动画效果可以试试看。\n\n同样 emil 的一系列交互的 skills 和 matt 的技术 skills 应该是地球上安装的最多的两种了吧，值得好好研究下。","ts":"2026-11-09 20:49","ed":"2026-11-10/night","why":"教AI做丝滑手势的Skill","m":[],"u":"https://x.com/vikingmute/status/2119774277503512646","pm":[1,7,22,3064]}]},{"h":"Vincent_AINotes","n":"Vincent","av":"media/t/vincent_ainotes_av.webp","posts":[{"id":"2119868190985695419","t":"Anthropic 正式发布 Claude Fable 5.2 和 Claude Mythos 5.2！\n\n这次升级有点猛，几个细节值得关注：\n\n1. 1000 个 Agent，30 小时完成费马大定理的形式化证明。\n\nAnthropic 称，1000 个 Fable 5.2 Agent 协同工作，只用了 30 小时就完成了费马大定理证明的形式化。此前的研究版本花了 11 天。\n\n2. 从零打造一个操作系统。\n\nFable 5.2 协调 1000 多个子 Agent，连续工作 8 天，从空文件夹开始，最终做出了一个可以在笔记本电脑上启动的操作系统。\n\n3. 编码能力进一步拉开差距。\n\n在 FrontierCode 2.0 测试中，Fable 5.2 的 Xhigh 成绩达到 49.1%，超过 Opus 5.5 的 45.5% 和 GPT-6 Astra 的 42.8%。\n\n4. 更快，而且更便宜。\n\n相比 Fable 5.1，生成速度最高提升 30%。\n\nAPI 价格也下调至：\n\n- 输入：$8 / 百万 Token\n- 输出：$40 / 百万 Token\n\n另外还提供 Fast Mode，最高提速 2.5 倍。\n\n5. Fable 和 Mythos 到底有什么区别？\n\n两者实际上是同一个底层模型。Fable 配备更严格的网络安全和生物安全防护，面向普通用户；Mythos 则面向经过审核的网络安全和生命科学研究机构。\n\n值得注意的是，Claude Fable 5.2 的 API 已经同步开放，模型 ID 为 claude-fable-5-2，Claude Platform、AWS、Google Cloud 和 Azure 均已支持。\n\n这次 Anthropic 想展示的，显然不只是一个更聪明的聊天模型，而是一个能够协调大量 Agent，持续完成复杂工程、数学和科研任务的 AI。","ts":"2026-11-10 03:02","ed":"2026-11-10/night","why":"Fable 5.2细节盘点","m":[],"u":"https://x.com/Vincent_AINotes/status/2119868190985695419","pm":[7,0,4,1859]}]},{"h":"vista8","n":"向阳乔木","av":"media/t/vista8_av.webp","posts":[{"id":"2119744512448987155","t":"Capwise 开源录屏软件内测版来了！\n\n1. 录好视频，自动生成双语字幕\n2. 鼠标点击自动缩放，快捷键展示\n3. 摄像头美颜，录屏背景美化\n4. 支持 CLI ，第三方 Agent 调用自动录屏\n\n本视频由 Capwise 录制，自闭环了。\n\n开源地址和官网见评论区","ts":"2026-11-09 18:50","ed":"2026-11-10/night","why":"开源录屏工具支持Agent调用","m":[{"src":"media/x/13_2119742207704084480.jpg","type":"video","w":1664,"h":1080,"t":"media/t/13_2119742207704084480.webp"}],"u":"https://x.com/vista8/status/2119744512448987155","pm":[76,21,158,18290]}]},{"h":"xiaohu","n":"小互","av":"media/t/xiaohu_av.webp","posts":[{"id":"2119774478788141417","t":"字节Seedream 5.5正式发布\n支持多轮像素级编辑能力  一致性保持简直炸裂\n\nSeedream 5.5，极大改善了多轮编辑稳定性、真实感升级、小字与多语言渲染、透明图、gif图生成等能力\n\n最多支持超过 100 轮的编辑而不损失图像\n\n下面是我的测试↓\n\n经过30多轮编辑，人物和文字在他们的位置上死死定住，连小字都能定住","ts":"2026-11-09 20:49","ed":"2026-11-10/night","why":"Seedream 5.5多轮编辑实测","m":[{"src":"media/x/16_2119770855102455809.jpg","type":"animated_gif","w":816,"h":1088,"t":"media/t/16_2119770855102455809.webp"}],"u":"https://x.com/xiaohu/status/2119774478788141417","pm":[27,12,143,14432]},{"id":"2119745234167050582","t":"在家里放了个Mac mini\n然后和自己的笔记本进行了连接\n\n一部分任务完全在mini 上运行，我可以从笔记本上远程直接在终端里进行对话\n\n所有开发以及其他任务可以实时进行同步，我现在可以随时关上笔记本出门，其中一部分任务还能进行实时同步...\n\n通过Rex进行终端同步，也可以通过uu远程进行操控...\n\n同时mini还能作为家庭中枢...","ts":"2026-11-09 18:53","ed":"2026-11-10/night","why":"Mac mini当远程Agent主机","m":[{"src":"media/x/3_2119745178277953536.jpg","type":"photo","w":906,"h":1120,"t":"media/t/3_2119745178277953536.webp"}],"u":"https://x.com/xiaohu/status/2119745234167050582","pm":[37,5,70,17392]}]},{"h":"xiaomovps","n":"小墨同学","av":"media/t/xiaomovps_av.webp","posts":[{"id":"2119772167231693052","t":"国内 AI Coding 套餐现在真的卷起来了，40 元左右就能用上不少旗舰模型 🔥\n\n我最近看很多 AI 厂商都开始发福利了，我就去逛了一圈 看一下国内大厂的 AI Coding Plan，发现现在很多厂商都开始转向 Credits、Token 等额度计费，套餐也越来越适合 Claude Code、OpenCode、OpenClaw 这些 Agent 工具","ts":"2026-11-09 20:40","ed":"2026-11-10/night","why":"国内AI Coding套餐对比","m":[{"src":"media/x/3_2119771739542753280.jpg","type":"photo","w":3432,"h":1736,"t":"media/t/3_2119771739542753280.webp"},{"src":"media/x/3_2119771739467173888.jpg","type":"photo","w":3432,"h":1736,"t":"media/t/3_2119771739467173888.webp"},{"src":"media/x/3_2119771739551154176.jpg","type":"photo","w":3432,"h":1736,"t":"media/t/3_2119771739551154176.webp"}],"u":"https://x.com/xiaomovps/status/2119772167231693052","pm":[9,1,27,6761]},{"id":"2119733737126563952","t":"DeepSeek Harness 官方推荐插件集合，这 4 个插件值得收藏！🔥\n\nDeepSeek Harness 的第三方插件已经达到 3.5 万个了，但这么多插件，到底哪些值得安装？\n\n最近官方专门介绍了 4 个社区开发者的作品，我整理了一下，涵盖自媒体创作、设计排版、上下文管理和论文阅读，都是比较实用的方向","ts":"2026-11-09 18:08","ed":"2026-11-10/night","why":"DeepSeek Harness插件推荐","m":[{"src":"media/x/3_2119731105570107393.jpg","type":"photo","w":2560,"h":1280,"t":"media/t/3_2119731105570107393.webp"},{"src":"media/x/3_2119731179394113536.jpg","type":"photo","w":1160,"h":900,"t":"media/t/3_2119731179394113536.webp"},{"src":"media/x/3_2119731297086283776.jpg","type":"photo","w":1232,"h":1240,"t":"media/t/3_2119731297086283776.webp"},{"src":"media/x/3_2119731362148372480.jpg","type":"photo","w":3344,"h":2000,"t":"media/t/3_2119731362148372480.webp"}],"u":"https://x.com/xiaomovps/status/2119733737126563952","pm":[4,5,26,3522]}]},{"h":"xiaoxiaodong","n":"小小东","av":"media/t/xiaoxiaodong_av.webp","posts":[{"id":"2119810390855184826","t":"Gemini 4 Argon (Medium)\n创意探索也好有趣\n\n比如我家橙子快要熟了   我想要它给9个创意\n3x3 排列\n\n这组提示词帮忙了一点点小忙：\n\n```\n围绕任意主题内容建立顶栏统领的多格矩阵式编辑视觉版面：让主题被拆解并转译为一组并置在洁净亮白网格中的独立视觉切片，以顶部居中的超特大粗黑标题压住全场，下方通过笔直等宽的亮白通道切分出上下并列的多个修长分格，让同一主题在不同分格中分别以立体折面体块、上下明暗分界场、层叠轮廓切面、错落纵窄取景窗、暗场微缩发光体与留白水彩晕染等多元造型手法展开，形成一眼纵览主题全貌的丰富阵列。视线先落在顶部宽阔亮白区的浓墨大字上，随后顺着正交白道滑入下方各格，在相邻分格的一明一暗、一密一疏之间横向游走，最后收束于各格底部的精细联署带与角落印记。最核心的独门动作是亮白网格统领下的多格异构并置：每个分格都拥有完整的顶角微标、中部视觉焦点与底部信息栏三段式结构，并在格与格之间形成明度高低与媒介手法的交替跳接，不能退化成缺乏内部排版秩序的简单图片拼接或杂乱拼贴；另一独门动作是分格内部的跨界咬合字形处理——有的分格将高对比衬线大字直接横跨在上下明暗交界线上，有的将三个大号衬线字极度拉宽字距横贯格宽并压住水平分割线，有的用纤细竖向线框收纳竖排长题并与旁侧错落高低的窄幅图像条精密对位，不能退化成每一格都套用同一种居中贴字的单调模板。排版系统采用双层网格：外层由顶部居中总轴线与四周等宽亮白边距控制；内层在各分格中灵活切换中轴对称、左齐窄栏与竖排右起队列。字号阶梯拉开五至六级反差，外层顶题采用笔画浑厚、转角利落的特粗无衬线字形；分格内则将端正的横细竖粗字形、高对比现代衬线体、克制无衬线细体与局部灵动的手写行书混搭使用。横贯格宽的字组与底边通栏小字极度拉开字距，多行说明文字则字距紧致、行距疏朗；各格顶角对位安放微型标识，中部穿插垂直细引线、小号副题与局部放大的手写数字，底边整齐排布水平细线、紧凑数字串与方形信息码块，文字内容均由主题生成。色彩上，外层底场固定为高明度洁净亮白，顶题采用极深浓墨；分格内部的色相从主题自身的材质、冷暖情绪与语义中提取，按格交替分配为清亮中浅色场、柔和暖调亮场、深邃低明度暗场与高明度留白淡彩场，分格文字严格取与所在底场拉开明度距离的亮白或深墨色，建立起“亮白外框—明暗交错分格—强对比字层”的稳定层级。外层底板平滑利落，分格内综合运用高精度立体渲染、局部微距切片与水洗晕染笔触，所有文字与细线边缘始终保持锐利平整。整体必须保留“顶题统领的亮白正交网格与多格异构跨界排版彼此牵制”的视觉机制，避免变成单一画面的常规排版或毫无章法的素材堆砌。\n\n——————\n主题：橙子电商用图\n比例3:4\n一共9个创意\n3x3\n```","ts":"2026-11-09 23:12","ed":"2026-11-10/night","why":"Gemini 4 Argon九宫格提示词","m":[{"src":"media/x/3_2119810107009892352.jpg","type":"photo","w":1086,"h":1448,"t":"media/t/3_2119810107009892352.webp"}],"u":"https://x.com/xiaoxiaodong/status/2119810390855184826","pm":[2,6,30,2568]},{"id":"2119793406675407266","t":"GPT2 x  agy x 海报 x 提示词 \n\n说句好听话：\n任何市面上主图能读图的模型\n都可以做出不错的图片提示词！\n\n我甚至尝试luna也可以...\n\n今天更是尝试了土耳其那款60美金 20x 的谷歌的模型\n可以，相当可以... \n甚至有可能成为我近期，心头最爱。\n\n这几天测试下，它的消耗情况，在和大家分享。\n\n感觉被低估的模型中，agy家的可能真有。\n\n不能什么都按照代码写的好不好来评判吧。\n\n如下样张提示词就是谷歌家模型写的\n模型：Gemini 4 Argon (Medium)。\n\n作图记录VCR:\n[[https://chatgpt.com/share/6af1d30b-3f40-83ea-b313-de8583cc85bc|chatgpt.com/share/6af1d30b…]]","ts":"2026-11-09 22:05","ed":"2026-11-10/night","why":"读图模型写图片提示词","m":[{"src":"media/x/3_2119792222552137729.jpg","type":"photo","w":1024,"h":1536,"t":"media/t/3_2119792222552137729.webp"},{"src":"media/x/3_2119792227522400256.jpg","type":"photo","w":1024,"h":1536,"t":"media/t/3_2119792227522400256.webp"}],"u":"https://x.com/xiaoxiaodong/status/2119793406675407266","pm":[1,4,40,3629]}]},{"h":"xiax0603","n":"xiax｜AI & Agents","av":"media/t/xiax0603_av.webp","posts":[{"id":"2119902835634766334","t":"🚨答疑｜Claude Pro 限时使用 Fable 5.2，是扣原有周额度，不是另外单算扣额度❗  \n\n很多20美元Pro用户都在问这个问题，一次性讲明白规则： \n\n这一周的 Pro 限免，Fable 是从你 Pro 本身原有的周额度里面扣，不是额外新增独立额度，上限最多占到你周额度的 50%，这段时间不再单独扣付费 credits","ts":"2026-11-10 05:19","ed":"2026-11-10/night","why":"Pro用户Fable额度规则","m":[],"u":"https://x.com/xiax0603/status/2119902835634766334","pm":[13,3,13,3625]},{"id":"2119778486072070638","t":"🚨重磅！Qwen4-27B 传闻定档周二夜！上周日发布落空后，Reddit 给出新时间❗\n\n✧ 据 /r/Qwen_AI 的 Reddit 帖子，Qwen4-27B 定于周二 11 月 10 日太平洋时间晚 11 点发布，对应东部时间晚 8 点。\n\n✧此前在 X 上看到的另一批帖子称上周日就是发布日，当天未见发布，说法落空。\n\n✧ 据观察：Alibaba_Qwen 最常见的发布日是周三，周二夜这个时间点仍需以官方为准。","ts":"2026-11-09 21:05","ed":"2026-11-10/night","why":"Qwen4-27B发布时间传闻","m":[{"src":"media/x/3_2119778478904266752.jpg","type":"photo","w":1164,"h":1027,"t":"media/t/3_2119778478904266752.webp"}],"u":"https://x.com/xiax0603/status/2119778486072070638","pm":[16,3,24,4484]}]},{"h":"yetone","n":"yetone","av":"media/t/yetone_av.webp","posts":[{"id":"2119752096421687336","t":"X 首页一刷新，刚看到一半的好帖子就没了？\n\n做了个小插件 Rewind for X：默默记下你在首页刷过的每条推文，随时打开侧栏回看、搜索。数据只存在你自己电脑上，不上传任何东西。\n\n开源 👉 [[https://github.com/yetone/rewind-for-x|github.com/yetone/rewind-…]]","ts":"2026-11-09 19:20","ed":"2026-11-10/night","why":"开源插件回看刷过的推文","m":[{"src":"media/x/3_2119752046748577792.jpg","type":"photo","w":1400,"h":560,"t":"media/t/3_2119752046748577792.webp"}],"u":"https://x.com/yetone/status/2119752096421687336","pm":[72,65,789,47280]}]},{"h":"Yuchenj_UW","n":"Yuchen Jin","av":"media/t/yuchenj_uw_av.webp","posts":[{"id":"2119882453334798847","t":"A moment of appreciation for DeepSeek and OSS models.\n\n44x cheaper than Claude Fable 5.2 per task.\n\nReminder: 95% of your tasks don't need the smartest model.","ts":"2026-11-10 03:58","ed":"2026-11-10/night","why":"开源模型便宜44倍","m":[{"src":"media/x/3_2119882419352584192.jpg","type":"photo","w":1458,"h":1084,"t":"media/t/3_2119882419352584192.webp"}],"u":"https://x.com/Yuchenj_UW/status/2119882453334798847","pm":[47,30,393,14507],"tz":"向 DeepSeek 和开源模型致敬一下。\n\n每个任务比 Claude Fable 5.2 便宜 44 倍。\n\n提醒：你 95% 的任务都不需要最聪明的模型。"},{"id":"2119852921244524895","t":"Agent Skills is definitely a transitional technology.\n\nWhy write a 1,000-line skill md when an agent can just watch you do something once, and figure out how to do it better?\n\nA truly general and smart agent shouldn’t need a manual for every task.","ts":"2026-11-10 02:01","ed":"2026-11-10/night","why":"Agent Skills只是过渡","m":[],"u":"https://x.com/Yuchenj_UW/status/2119852921244524895","pm":[50,13,269,11978],"tz":"Agent Skills 绝对是一种过渡性技术。\n\n既然智能体看你做一遍就能学会、还能想出更好的做法，为什么还要写一份 1000 行的 skill md？\n\n一个真正通用又聪明的智能体，不应该每个任务都需要一本说明书。"}]},{"h":"zachlloydtweets","n":"Zach Lloyd","av":"media/t/zachlloydtweets_av.webp","posts":[{"id":"2119801501417611347","t":"Agree. “Factory” is not a perfect term but the move up in abstraction is real. It’s a shift towards engineering agentic systems away from directly prompting agents. [[https://twitter.com/mattpocockuk/status/2119748545691402733|x.com/mattpocockuk/s…]]","ts":"2026-11-09 22:37","ed":"2026-11-10/night","why":"软件工厂是抽象层升级","m":[],"u":"https://x.com/zachlloydtweets/status/2119801501417611347","pm":[25,4,123,5932],"tz":"同意。“工厂”不是一个完美的说法，但抽象层次的提升是真实的。这是从直接给智能体写提示词，转向构建智能体系统的工程化转变。 [[https://twitter.com/mattpocockuk/status/2119748545691402733|x.com/mattpocockuk/s…]]"}]}]);
